<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Arum Bibleh Translation</book>
  <para style="h">MARKUS</para>
  <para style="toc1">Markus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Markus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsifa Nana Anyi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARKUS</para>
  <para style="imt">Ikpi Tsifa</para>
  <para style="im">Tsifa nana ata nza anyi na Markus reh, a jiji na tsifa la, &lt;&lt;tsifa nana ma ikpi Yeso Kristi Amehreh Nnoh.&gt;&gt; Ma a gu Yeso twanza kyangwri ata nza a bu na wuwana ata lisa awumu mboh. Ma a nza wuwana a ŋoh reh atsi tsana tasa za ma ikpi inyo mboh, tasa za ma atsi hwara kpakpana kyangwri mboh. Yeso atsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh tswanza amehreh kyangwri, ata ŋoh nza a ba atsi gu ikpi a ŋoh a fanga la ŋoh ta a sa kyangwri mboh a hwana anyi na kpakpana amoh mboh.</para>
  <para style="ip">Markus a tsana tsifa Yeso yehlehleh, tasa za awumu amboh ata Yeso ta ka a leh a lisa reh a keh tsifa a ŋoh mboh tasa tsana a ŋoh mboh. Kyangwri ŋa reh atsifa ma ikpi Ayohana kyangwri wra batisma tasa tsara Yeso a treh feh sa ka atsifa ma ikpi nga wuwana ma amboh bishi mboh tasa tsana a ŋoh mboh. A mehheh neh amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a leh a sehreh tsifa a ŋoh mboh reh a wina, amboh ata neh nza ma a kira na a ŋoh kpeh reh maka a leh a lisa a te gofo a keh. Amgbasho reh za atsifa ma ikpi kpa ata nza ma a kpa ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh reh tasa hinga a ŋoh anyi ma kwo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ayohana Kyangwri Wra Batisma A lisa Aki A gya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Ama 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ata areh a bu jiji tsifa nana alindeh ma ikpi Yeso Kristi Amehreh Nnoh reh.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />A bu ŋa gya nimeh amgbasho Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh reh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">&lt;&lt;Meh nati tohmoh amboh tohmoh amya mboh na ma tohmoh na amohnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">ata nza a nati a lisa aki amohnoh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />&lt;&lt;Agba akyo anyi a buti fi ma hohroh babba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">&lt;Lisa nnoh aki ma Ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">lisa nnoh akeki a ŋoh mboh reh ta a bu yehlehleh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ayohana tana a ba dehreh za, tana wra batisma ma kyangwri mboh ma akpo babba anyi tasa ta ka hwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh ma kyangwri mboh la mata gyuruna ta agugu amoh mboh reh ata mata a wra mboh batisma, la Nnoh ta a gu kpakpana amoh reh te kohhroh. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Akpo afiya Yahudiya nambri, tasa kyangwri Urushalima mboh nambri tama ka a na na a ŋoh, mata ka a bleh na aniye amoh kpakpana amoh mboh reh, a ka a leh a wra mboh batisma ma fini Urdu. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Ayohana tana a were akuri shina nyama, tasa ta ka a lafa lana bina ma kravo a ŋoh, tasa tana ka a rya tawa tasa amwo itoh. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ka a leh ka hwra tsifa Nnoh reh a bleh la: &lt;&lt;Ma inyina amya akyo anyi a nati a ba ata nza a keh meh wuwana, ata mya meh tswa meh ti dohnoh hingre rishi akpehtreh hwana a ŋoh mboh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Meh wra nnoh batisma na amwo, ŋoh neh a nati a wra nnoh batisma na huru zanana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wra Batisma Tasa Tsara Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Ama 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Na ameh wohroh reh Yeso tana anyi Nazaret ma akpo afiya Galili, Ayohana ka a wra ŋoh batisma ma fini Urdu. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yeso nza ka buti kate anyi ma amwo reh, ka a nza inza a buti hwashina a vuruna tasa huru Nnoh ka tamba ma ikpi a ŋoh tswanza ikukuba. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Tasa agba anyi ka a tsifa anyi inza la: &lt;&lt;Ni bu Amehreh amya, ata mya nza ni kira; na anzoh agohsoh amya ka a kukuna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ma hwana anyimbehreh Huru Nnoh reh ka a kama ŋoh a na hohroh babba. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Yeso reh ka a bu ma hohroh babba reh a te ibi agrumavoh ida anneh, agugu reh ka a leh a tsara ŋoh a nza. Maka a bu mboh ma agbugba woaye mboh, a ka a bu mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh maka a leh shingi ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A fi amboh Sa tohmoh A ŋoh Mboh amboh Jiji Reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Ama 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Nza maka a de Ayohana a fi ma ida ka reh, Yeso ka a na a ŋoh Galili, atsi hwra tsifa nana Nnoh reh a bleh. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />A ka leh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ameh kǝ su,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh kǝ ba nda. Ta nnoh akeki agugu amohnoh mboh reh ti sa nnoh tsifa nana Nnoh reh kira nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yeso ta ka a buti hende ma akechi fini agba ata Galili, ka a nza Siman mboh ma atsini Andarawus, ma a leh a were arishi de kpo nimeh amwo, mboh reh tama bu amboh de kpo mboh. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ba bu wa meh noh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Meh nati gyuru nnoh ti bu noh amboh wa nnoh kyangwri mboh ba nnoh na amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ma hwana anyimbehreh maka de a hinga ata arishi de kpo amoh mboh reh, maka a tufa ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Nza maka a na amoh ma tohmoh shidi, a ka gyuru a nza Yakubu amehreh Zabadi, tasa atsini Ayohana nimeh gbogblondo amwo atsi leh lisa arishi de kpo amoh mboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ma a huru heri ka a fi mboh, maka a de a hinga ata alehmeh amoh Zabadi mboh ma amboh ndohmoh mboh reh nimeh gbogblondo amwo maka a tufa ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A katsi Huru Agugu A kate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Maka a na amoh Kafarnahum, ibi Asabar nza ka a ba, Yeso ka aniye nimeh Ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh ka leh a tsana kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Kyangwri maka leh a ŋara aniye na tsana a ŋoh mboh reh, la a leh a tsana mboh tswanza akyo ata a bu na wuwana reh, a sohroh a bu tswanza amboh tsana akpi Musa reh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ma a huru heri kyangwri anyi a yama nimeh Ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, a bu na huru agugu, a ka a leh a te kpiriga la, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />&lt;&lt;Ni kira mboh na ambohroh, nnoh Yeso ata Nazaret? Ha la ni ba ti lofo reh? Meh wina akyo ata nza bu noh reh, ni bu zanana ata Nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yeso ka a hwa huru agugu reh la, &lt;&lt;Bu gbalala! Kate nyi ma itoh kyangwri ata areh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Huru agugu reh ka a zuzu kyangwri reh yivoh, ta ka a te kpiriga agba a treh feh sa ka a kate ata ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a shi a ŋara aniye, maka a leh luhu itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh bu umbo? Tsana Afeh Anyi uwe tasa na wuwana! A leh a vuru aniye atsi leh tsifa na huru agugu mboh reh, maka a leh a kira na tsifa a ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />A yanda kpeh tsifa a ŋoh reh ka a treh atsifi ma akpokpo afiyafiya Galili reh nambri.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana Ma Vara Kyangwri Mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Ama 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Yeso mboh nza maka a kate anyi ma Ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, maka a na amoh afiya Abitrusu tasa Andarawus, mboh ma Yakubu tasa Ayohana. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Akre agba Siman neh ka a leh ma ikpi abla la itoh ŋoh a hwene, maka a bleh Yeso ma ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />A ka a na na a de ivoh a ŋoh a wa ŋoh a ka ma inza. Bishi hwene itoh reh ka ata ŋoh, a ka a de a hinga a trisa mboh irya.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Na mgba nvishi neh nnoh kǝ hwa, kyangwri mboh maka a leh a fira amboh bishi mboh tasa amboh bishi inyo mboh gaga a ba ma Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Kyangwri mboh ma akpo afiya reh nambri maka a ba ba a shi ŋoh ma anida, <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yeso ka nga wuwana ma vara amboh bishi mboh reh ma atsetse. Tasa za ka a leh a katsi vara inyo mboh a kate, ŋoh neh a sohroh a kira la inyo mboh reh ma atsifa kpeh, la inyo mboh reh ma a wina ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A kwere Nnoh Ma Atsi Huho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Na nerebi shishini ma, Yeso ka a de a hinga a kate ata afiya, a ka a na ŋoh atsi huho anyi atsi leh kwere Nnoh. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Siman tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu mboh ma amoh reh maka a leh a hehndeh a fa ŋoh, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />nza maka a nza ŋoh reh, maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba ma a leh a hehndeh a fa nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ba turoh meh na ambohroh akpokpo afiyafiya mboh nza ma a treh a bu ma tohmoh reh, meh ti na ni hwra tsifa bleh mboh za. A bu tsifa ata areh ŋa mya nza ni ba reh. <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />A ka a hehndeh a treh atsifi ma akpokpo afiyafiya Galili mboh reh, atsi leh hwra tsifa Nnoh ma dida Nnoh Yahudawa mboh reh, tasa za a ka a leh a katsi inyo mboh a kate anyi ma itoh kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Bishi Kohmoh A hunji Wuwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Ama 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Kyangwri bishi kohmoh anyi a ba na Yeso, a ka a susuna na a gboro a leh kwere ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni kira, ni nati wina lisa meh meh ti bu fyafya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yeso ka nza kwini a ŋoh, a ka atsitsi ivoh a ŋoh a bara ŋoh, ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh kira, mya meh lisa nnoh, bu fyafya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ma a huru heri, bishi kohmoh reh ka a kate ata ŋoh, a ka bu na zanana.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la ta a na ŋoh neh ta ka akpi ŋoh ashotoh la, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />&lt;&lt;Sehreh, kama bleh ma akyo kpeh, nnoh neh na ti tsana ikpi anzoh ma Firist, ti nga ŋoh awumu nana agohsoh ika ata Musa ta ka a bleh la ma a lisa reh mata hwara ta a bu fyafya reh, lisa dehreh la ti tsana ma kyangwri mata a nza la ni hunji wuwana. <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ŋoh neh ka a na ŋoh, atsi leh hende hwra tsifa nana reh a bleh na agohsoh anyimbehreh. Ma ikpi tsifa wohroh reh, Yeso a za a wina na akpo afiya anyi mata a nza ŋoh za kpeh, ka a leh a hehndeh a tuma ma inziyo atsi ata kyangwri mboh ma a yama kpeh. Kyangwri mboh maka a leh a ba na a ŋoh anyi akpokpo atsifi mboh.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yeso A nga Kyangwri kwo Tamba Mgba Anyi Wuwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Ama 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />A te ibi afri kpeh, Yeso nza ka a gyuru a ba a ŋoh Kafarnahum, kyangwri maka a sehreh la kǝ ba a ŋoh afiya. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Kyangwri gaga maka a ba ma a huru, atsi soh hwana a za a yama kpeh, a gu a ba ba a te ma anida inziyo. Yeso ka a leh ahwra tsifa Nnoh reh a bleh mboh. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Kyangwri amboh anyi mboh anneh, maka a de kyangwri anyi ata nza a kwo a tamba mgba anyi a ba na Yeso ma atakpa. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ma a sohroh hunji aki mata a de ŋoh a na ni Yeso reh kpeh, tsifa la kyangwri ma a keh gaga, maka a gu kyangwri bishi reh a ka ma ikpi tsitsi ida reh maka a vuru iwi reh neh maka a de ŋoh ka a tamba ma atakpa ma tohmoh Yeso ma atsitsifi duma mboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yeso nza ka a nza nga agohsoh amoh reh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Amehreh, ma a te kohhroh na kpakpana anzoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />amboh tsana akpi Musa amboh anyi neh tama tuma ma a huru, maka a leh a kohnoh nimeh agohsoh amoh mboh, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />maka a leh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu lele feh kyangwri ata areh a leh atsifa dehreh? A leh atsifa a kya Nnoh! A bu anyi ata nza a bu na wuwana ata te kohhroh na kpakpana ambohroh mboh nza ta bu Nnoh kpeh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ma a huru heri Yeso ka a wina nimeh huru a ŋoh andromboh ata nza ma a leh a kohnoh nimeh agohsoh amoh reh, a ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni leh kohnoh nnoh awumu amboh areh nimeh agohsoh amohnoh mboh tsifa umbo? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Atamaa a bu na iya kpeh: mata a bleh ma kyangwri ata nza a kwo a tamba mgba anyimbehreh reh la, &lt;Ma a te kohhroh na kpakpana anzoh,&gt; ha mata a bleh la, &lt;De hinga, gu atakpa anzoh ti hende&gt;? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Mya neh meh kira ti wina noh la Amehreh kyangwri a bu na wuwana ta a te kohhroh na kpakpana mboh ma inziyo areh.&gt;&gt; A ka a bleh ma kyangwri ata nza a kwo a tamba mgba anyimbehreh reh la, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />&lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh, De hinga, gu atakpa anzoh ti na anzoh afiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />A ka a de hinga heri, ta ka a sa atakpa a ŋoh a gu, feh sa ka a kate ma tohmoh amoh nambri. Kyangwri mboh ma a huru reh maka a leh a ŋara aniye a nza ŋoh a na tasa za maka a leh riri Nnoh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh hehreh nza andromboh anyi dehreh kpeh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A fi Alawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Ama 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yeso ka a gyuru a kate za a na a ŋoh akechi fini akre Galili. Vara kyangwri maka a leh a ba na a ŋoh, ŋoh ka a leh a tsana mboh. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Nza ka a buti gǝga reh, a ka a nza Alawi amehreh Halfa atsi tuma te ndohmoh nimeh ida sa hungroh gandu. Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ba bu wa meh.&gt;&gt; Alawi ka a de a hinga a wa ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Yeso nza ka a buti rya irya nvishi ma afiya Alawi, mgbiri amboh sa hungroh gandu mboh gaga tasa amboh kpakpana mboh za ma a leh a rya irya mboh ma a ŋoh tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh, kyangwri gaga tama tufa ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />amboh tsana akpi Musa amboh anyi amboh ata nza ma a bu Farisiyawa mboh, maka a nza ŋoh atsi rya irya mboh ma amboh kpakpana mboh tasa amboh sa hungroh gandu reh, maka a luhu amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;A bu lele fa a leh a rya mboh ma amboh sa hungroh gandu mboh tasa amboh kpakpana umbo?<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Nza ka a sehreh dehreh, Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A sohroh a bu amboh wuwana maka a fa kyangwri wra kpeh, neh ka a bu kyangwri bishi mi. Meh ba la meh ti fi amboh tufa yehlehleh kpeh, ba amya reh neh a bu tsifa amboh kpakpana mboh mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A luhu Yeso Ma Ikpi De Aniye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Ama 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />amboh tufa Ayohana tasa Farisiyawa mboh tama leh de aniye. Mgbiri kyangwri mboh maka a ba ba a luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;amboh tufa Ayohana tasa Farisiyawa mboh reh ma a leh a de aniye reh tsifa mboh amboh tufa anzoh mboh neh ma a sohroh a de kpeh?<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh ni kira nnoh sene mboh nza ma a bu ma ida wa afya reh mata a na amoh na inyo? Areh a nati a bu dehreh kpeh! Nza atsifa akehreh reh a treh a yama na amoh reh ma a nati a wina de aniye kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ameh a nati a ba neh ata ma a nati a gu atsifa reh ata nnoh, a bu ibi wohroh nza ma a nati de aniye reh.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />&lt;&lt;Akyo a nati a wina wono kuri hwashina atono na hwashi kuri afeh kpeh, nza a lisa dehreh reh, hwashi kuri afeh reh a nati a gununa, hwashina reh a nati ka a lisa a keh. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Tasa za akyo a nati a wina were amwo mara agbeh inabi afeh a na nimeh amgbo atono mboh kpeh. Nza a lisa dehreh, amwo mara agbeh inabi afeh reh a nati a vasa amgbo reh, amwo mara agbeh inabi reh a nati a sangrana. Amwo inabi afeh reh a nati a zohhoh na gama afeh za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A bu Ada Ata Ibi Asabar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Ama 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ibi Asabar anyi, Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh maka a buti a gǝga ma inzi akroh ma ibi asabar. amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh nyo ka a keh mboh maka a leh a tanga yohroh akpi akroh reh a leh a rya. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Farisiyawa mboh reh maka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Nza! a bu lele feh amboh tufa anzoh mboh reh ma a bu ti lisa andromboh ata nza a zohhoh kpeh ma ibi asabar reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />A ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ni hehreh bleh nza noh andromboh ata Dawuda ta ka a lisa na ameh ata ŋoh tasa iziza mboh nyo ta ka a keh mboh reh kpeh? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Ameh ata Abiyata ta ka a bu agba Firist ma ida Nnoh reh, Dawuda ka aniye a na ma ida Nnoh reh, ŋoh ka a rya irya ata nza a zohhoh mata a nga ma amboh te ndohmoh ma ida Nnoh mboh tsimoh mata a rya reh. A ka a nga mgbiri ma ziza a ŋoh mboh za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />A ka a bleh Mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ibi Asabar reh ma a lisa a gya ma kyangwri mi, ma a sohroh a lisa kyangwri tsifa ibi asabar kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Nza a bu dehreh Amehreh kyangwri reh a bu Ada tasa ata ibi Asabar za,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri ata Ivoh a ŋoh Anvinvina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Ama 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yeso nza ka a hinga anyi ma a huru, a ka aniye a na Ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, a ka a nza kyangwri anyi ivoh a ŋoh Anvinvina kǝ shi ma a huru. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Kyangwri mboh reh ma a buti bana la mboh mata hunji Yeso na kpakpana, maka a were ŋoh iyo mata a nza la ha a nati a nga wuwana ma kyangwri bishi reh ibi Asabar?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yeso ka a bleh ma kyangwri ata ivoh a ŋoh nza Anvinvina reh la,&lt;&lt;Kate ba bu shi ma tohmoh mareh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Yeso reh ka a luhu mboh la,&lt;&lt;Atamaa a keh zohhoh mata a lisa ma ibi Asabar: tama a lisa andromboh alindeh ha andromboh abibi, tama a sa fene a hwana ha tama a mla fene a kwo? Mboh neh maka a bu gbalala ma.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Ka a nza mboh a na nimeh gofo, tasa za a ka a bu na hungwa yira tsifa wuwa agohsoh amoh reh, a ka a bleh ma kyangwri reh la, &lt;&lt;Tsitsi ivoh anzoh kate.&gt;&gt; A ka atsitsi ivoh a ŋoh a kate, ivoh reh ka a gyuru a zohhoh yama. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Farisiyawa mboh nza maka a nza dehreh reh, maka a kate anyi ma ida Nnoh reh, heriheri maka a na na a dohsoh aniye mboh ma kyangwri Hirudus mboh ma ikpi akeki ata ma a nati a mla Yeso reh a kwo.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duma Ma A tufa Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yeso ka a hinga mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, maka a na amoh akechi fini Galili, vara kyangwri nza ma anyi Galili maka a leh a tufa ŋoh, tasa kyangwri Yahudiya mboh za, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />nza maka a sehreh andromboh ata nza a leh a lisa reh, vara kyangwri ma a ba na a ŋoh anyi Urushalima, tasa Edom, tasa iba fini Urdu, tasa Taya tasa Sidon. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />A ka a nza la duma mboh reh ma a keh gaga, ŋoh neh ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la ma a de gbogblondo amwo akehreh anyi a ba ŋoh, tsifa la kyangwri mboh mata a fla ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Yeso reh a lisa dehreh tsifa la ŋoh kǝ nga vara kyangwri mboh wuwana, mgbiri amboh bishi mboh maka a leh a ba ma inda a ŋoh la mata a bara ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ameh ata huru agugu mboh reh ma a nza ŋoh, maka a hwa ma inzi ma tohmoh a ŋoh maka a te kpiriga a kate la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu Amehreh Nnoh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ŋoh neh ka a bleh ma inyo mboh reh a wuwa la ma kama a bleh ma akyo la ha ŋoh a ka bu anyi kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A fi amboh Tufa A ŋoh Mboh Agrumavoh A hwa Afri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Ama 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yeso ka a ka a na ŋoh agbohgboh agba anyi, a ka a fi amboh ata ŋoh nza a kira reh la ma a na na a ŋoh ma a huru. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Nimeh amoh reh ka a seh kyangwri agrumavoh a hwa afri, ka a fi mboh la amboh sa tohmoh nana la mata a bu na a ŋoh. A kira la ŋoh ta ka a tohmoh mboh mata a leh hwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />ta ka nga mboh wuwana ata ma a nati a wina katsi huru agugu mboh a kate anyi ma itoh kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />amboh areh ma bu isa amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso a bleh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh: ata anyimbehreh, a bu Siman ata maka a fi ŋoh la Abitrusu; <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakubu amehreh zabadi, tasa atsini Ayohana; ata ŋoh nza a nga mboh isa la Buwarnajis, a bu mara kpalala mboh; <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Tasa za Andarawus, Filibus, Bartalomi, Amatiyu, Toma, Yakubu amehreh Halfa, Taddiyus, tasa Siman kyangwri Kaana, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />tasa Yahuda Iskariyoti ata ta ka a de Yeso a nga mboh reh.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Tasa Agohmoh inyo Mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Ama 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Yeso ka a gyuru a na afiya anyi, duma mboh ma a za a ba ba a dohsohna, ŋoh tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma a za hunji aki a rya irya za kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />amboh afiya a ŋoh mboh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a na la mata a na na a gu ŋoh a hinga ma a huru, mboh reh ma a gu la &lt;&lt;A te a kwere&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />amboh tsana akpi Musa amboh ata nza ma anyi Urushalima reh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu Baalzabul nza a bu agba inyo mboh nza a bu nimeh a ŋoh reh! A leh a fira inyo mboh a kate anyi ma itoh kyangwri mboh reh na wuwana a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yeso reh ka a fi mboh atsifa na amoh nimeh kakranda la, &lt;&lt;Agugu a nati a wina katsi agugu lele? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Nza kpra Agohmoh reh a gafa na na itoh a ŋoh, kpra Agohmoh reh a nati a shi kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Dehreh za, nza afiya reh a gafana a te afri, afiya anyi a nati a fi atohngoh ma tohmoh, afiya reh a nati a shi kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Nza Agugu za a nati a hinga ma ikpi a ŋoh, a nati a shi kpeh. Trina a ŋoh kǝ ba zizi.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Akyo a nati a wina niye a na afiya kyangwri wuwana ta a fira awumu a ŋoh kpeh, ma a nati a jiji a de kyangwri wuwana reh a lafa fya, sa ka a fira awumu afiya a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Meh bleh noh zizi, Nnoh a nati a te kohhroh na kpakpana ata kyangwri mboh nza ma a te reh, tasa za a nati a te kohhroh za na kpakpana kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi Nnoh reh za. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Akyo ata neh nza a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi Huru zanana reh, ma a nati a te kohhroh na a ŋoh kpeh ta tuma atono. Kpakpana a ŋoh reh a bu ata tuma atono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yeso a bleh tsifa reh dehreh tsifa ata nza ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu na huru agugu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akre Yeso Tasa Atsini Mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Ama 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Akre Yeso tasa atsini mboh maka a ba ba a shi ma inziyo, maka a tohmoh akyo anyi la ta a na na a fi Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Duma mboh maka a tuma ka a goh ŋoh, maka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Atono tasa atsi anzoh tasa asra anzoh mboh ma a leh a fa nnoh ma inziyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />A ka a luhu la,&lt;&lt;Anyi mboh maka a bu a na amya tasa atsi amya umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />A ka a nza amboh ata nza ma a tuma a goh ŋoh reh, a ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza a na amya tasa atsi amya mboh uwe! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Akyo ata nza a lisa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a kira reh a bu asra amya tasa atsi amya tasa a na amya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Kyangwri Biya biroh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Ama 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yeso ka a gyuru a leh a jiji a tsana mboh za ma akechi fini inzi Galili. Vara kyangwri maka a ba ba a goh ŋoh, a ka a de a hinga ka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh ta ka a tuma nimeh ma ikpi amwo reh. Vara kyangwri mboh reh feh maka a shi ma akechi fini akre. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />A ka a leh a tsana mboh vara awumu nimeh kakranda ta ka a bleh mboh la: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />&lt;&lt;Sehreh nnoh, kyangwri hafa a na atsi biya biroh. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Nza a bu ti hwina biroh reh, mgbiri tswa maka a hwa ma aki agba, akuku mboh maka a tanga a rya nambri. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />amboh mgbiri ma a hwa ma ikpi kpakpa mboh, atsi ata avru nza a yama gaga kpeh. A ka a hinga a ka na gbugbo, avru reh anyina ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Neh nnoh nza ka a hwene, awumu reh ka afya, maka a fifirohna, tsifa la ma a bu na ariri kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mgbiri amboh tswa maka a sangrana a na ma hohroh atohtoh mboh, atohtoh mboh reh maka a hinga a hahamba awumu mboh reh maka a mara za kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Mgbiri biroh amboh tswa za maka a hwa a na ma inzi ata avru a yama alindeh, ma a huru awumu reh ka a zohhoh alindeh, mgbiri ma bu yohroh agrumavoh ida atatoh, mgbiri ma bu agrumavoh ida atehrehkifi mgbiri ma bu agrumavoh ida agrumavoh a te na afri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sehreh, ta a sehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lomo Kakranda ma ikpi Kyangwri biya reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Ama 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ameh ata nza a buti tuma ŋoh tsene reh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh tasa mgbiri amboh ata nza ma a leh a tufa ŋoh reh, maka a na na luhu ŋoh ma ikpi kakranda mboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Lomo tsifa ayuhu ata kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh ma a nga noh mohnoh mi, amboh ata neh nza ma a bu ma inziyo reh, ma a nati a bleh mboh awumu mboh reh nimeh kakranda, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />a bu tsifa wohroh reh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">&lt;Ma a nati a nza, mboh neh ma a nati a nza a wina kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">ma bu na ashotoh sehreh, ma a nati a sehreh a wina kpeh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">la mata a sehreh a wina kpeh, mata ata kpakpana amoh mboh reh mata a te kohhroh na wohroh.<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso a lisa a bleh Tsifa ma ikpi Kakranda Kyangwri Biya reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Ama 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yeso reh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni sehreh noh kakranda ata areh reh wina noh kpeh? Ni nati lisa nnoh lele feh seh sehreh noh mgbiri kakranda mboh reh wina noh? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Kyangwri hwina biroh reh a hwina tsifa Nnoh. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Biroh ata nza a hwa ma ikpi aki reh, ma a tswanza kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa Nnoh reh. Mboh neh nza ma a sehreh reh, agugu a ba heri ta a ba ba a fira tsifa ata nza ma a biya nimeh agohsoh amoh reh. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Dehreh za na amboh ata nza ma a hwa ma ikpi kpakpa reh, ma tswanza amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa Nnoh reh maka a sa na johjoh. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Mboh neh nza ma a bu na ariri kpeh reh, ma a nati a shi a yanda kpeh. Nza iya a ba ha mata a nga iya ma akyo ma ikpi tsifa Nnoh reh, ma a nati a hwa na gbugbo. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Mgbiri amboh ata nza ma a hwa ma hohroh atohtoh reh, ma a tswanza amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa Nnoh reh, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />kohnoh awumu inziyo amboh ameh ata areh, tasa kira asabara, tasa hwa amwo iyo na mgbiri awumu mboh, ma a nati aniye mata a ha tsifa Nnoh reh te agba, ta a zohhoh za kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Biroh ata nza a hwa ma ikpi avru alindeh reh, a tswanza amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa Nnoh reh, maka a sa a te ndohmoh na wohroh, ma a huru awumu reh ka a zohhoh alindeh, mgbiri ma bu yohroh agrumavoh ida atatoh, mgbiri ma bu agrumavoh ida atehrehkifi, mgbiri ma bu agrumavoh ida agrumavoh a te na afri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afitila ma Hohroh Gbugba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yeso ka a gyuru a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ de afitila ba ti gya nnoh ma hohroh gbugba ha ma hohroh tundu? Maka a gu a kohhroh a gya ma ikpoh kohhroh shira ma atsi gyaa kpeh? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Andromboh anyi a yama ma huho nehnehreh ata ma a nati a wina vuru, tasa za andromboh ata ayuhu a yama ata ma a nati a bleh a kate. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sehreh tsifa reh, ta ka a sehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yeso ka a gyuru a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;Sehreh nnoh alindeh! Gbugba ata nza ni sara nnoh ma kyangwri mboh, ma a nati a lisa nnoh ika wohroh za, mata a lisa nnoh a mishi za. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Akyo ata nza a bu na andromboh, ma a nati a mishi ŋoh, akyo ata nza a bu na andromboh kpeh reh, ashidi ata nza a bu na wohroh reh, ma a nati a sa a hwana anyi na a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma ikpi biroh Ata Kǝ Fana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yeso ka a gyuru a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh a nati a bu dehreh, a nati a tswanza kyangwri hwina biroh ma inzi a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Na shini tasa na nnoh, tasa za ha ni leh mla ti gyuru hinga, biroh awumu reh ka a fana, kyangwri a wina ha a fana lele kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Avru ka a de biroh reh a fa na na akpi a ŋoh, asho ka a jiji a fana, a treh feh akru sa ka a kate, yohroh za ta ka a mara a kate. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Nza awumu irya reh kǝ bina, kyangwri a nati ka a gu ambya ta a fa awumu reh a were ma inzi heri, tsifa la ameh fasa awumu reh kǝ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Yohroh Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Ama 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yeso reh ka a gyuru a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati tsara kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh na umbo? Ha meh kǝ nati tsana noh kakranda atamaa ti nza noh la kpra Agohmoh reh a bu lele? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />A tswanza yohroh agbeh kumu, ata yohroh a ŋoh reh ka a keh mgbiri agbeh mboh reh akehreh ata nza ma a biya ma inzi reh. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Nza ka bu dehreh reh, nza ma a biya ŋoh reh, ka a hinga a te agba ta a keh mgbiri agbeh asho mboh ma aye reh, ka ahwra agbugba avohvoh mboh za, ata akuku inza mboh maka la avru amoh mboh ma lulu agbeh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Na biroh kakranda mboh nza ma a bu gaga dehreh reh, Yeso a bleh mboh tsifa Nnoh reh yehlehleh na nza wina amoh. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />A sohroh a bleh mboh andromboh anyi ata nza a bu nimeh kakranda kpeh reh. Ameh ata neh ta ka a bu mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, a tsana mboh awumu mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A de Inyo Agba Akuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Ama 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ibi wohroh reh na mgba nvishi, ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ba turoh meh hwa na na ambohroh iba fini ata ari&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Nza maka ata duma mboh reh ma inyina, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a na na aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo ata Yeso nza a bu nimeh reh, maka a gu ŋoh a na amoh. Mgbiri gbogblondo amwo mboh za tama a treh a yama ma a huru na a ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Shini anyi ka a ba na inyo agba ka a leh afo amwo reh, amwo ka a leh aniye a na nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh a tswanza wa a nati su. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yeso feh ka a buti leh a ŋoh mla ma atsi kuna ma inyina nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh. amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma a yiri ŋoh, maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, Mbohroh meh nati lofona, nnoh ni sohroh kohnoh na ambohroh kpeh tsifa umbo?<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yeso ka a de a hinga a ka a hwa inyo reh ta ka a bleh ma amwo fini reh za la, &lt;&lt;Bu tsehe! tasa za ti bu gbalala!&gt;&gt; Inyo reh ka a shi ma hwana anyimbehreh, tasa za atsifi reh ka bu gbalala.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />A ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ nyiri nnoh tsifa umbo? Ni treh bu noh na nga agohsoh kpeh a gu a ba a te nehnehreh?<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh maka a nyiri gaga tasa za maka luhu itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a ka bu anyi? Ata inyo tasa gohroh amwo ma a sa tsifa a ŋoh a kira!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana ma Kyangwri Bishi Inyo Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Ama 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh maka a hwana a na iba fini agba ata Galili, nza a bu ma akpo afiya Garasinawa mboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yeso nza ka a kate anyi ma gbogblondo amwo reh, kyangwri anyi a bu na huru agugu, a kate anyi ikpi nyifo, ka a ba ba hunji Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Kyangwri reh ka a leh ma ikpi nyifo. Akyo ka a mishi a wina de ŋoh kpeh, ha ma a lafa a ŋoh na njehnjehreh. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Maka a lafa ŋoh njehnjehreh ma ivoh tasa hwana, dehreh neh a ka a shishimba njehnjehreh reh a te amgbigbiri tasa za ka hwra karafi ata hwana reh. Akyo anyi a bu na wuwana ata de ŋoh fla a gya kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Na shini tasa na nnoh a ka hende ma ikpi nyifo mboh, tasa ma ikpi kpakpa mboh, ka a te kpiriga, ta ka tra itoh ŋoh na kpakpa mboh.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Nza ka a nza Yeso anyi gbugba, a ka a gbo a na na ada agboro ma inzi ma tohmoh Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Kyangwri ka a te kpiriga mama la,&lt;&lt;Meh kwere nnoh kavohshama ni kǝ kira umbo na amya, Yeso Amehreh Nnoh ata nza A keh Agba? fa meh aku na sa Nnoh la ni nati kama nga meh iya kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Kyangwri reh a bleh dehreh neh tsifa la Yeso tana a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Kate nyi ma itoh kyangwri reh, nnoh huru agugu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Ma huru Yeso ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Sa anzoh a bu anyi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">A ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Isa amya a bu Vara, tsifa la, Mbohroh meh bu vara agba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ta ka kwere Yeso gaga la ta kama a katsi mboh a kate anyi ma a huru kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Vara atambri afiya tama a buti hende fa rya ma nda akachi agbohgboh. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Huru agugu mboh reh maka kwere Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kira reh meh ti na ma atsi atambri afiya mboh nza ma a yama reh, meh ti na ni niye ma itoh amoh mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yeso ka a nga mboh kira, huru agugu mboh reh maka a kate ka aniye ma itoh atambri afiya mboh reh. Vara atambri afiya reh mboh mgba dubu afri, maka a hinga na gbo a tamba a na na a hwa ma amwo agba reh, maka a kwo.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />amboh sumu atambri afiya mboh reh nza maka a nza dehreh neh maka a gbo a na na a bleh ma akpo afiya amoh tasa akpo afiya agba amoh. kyangwri mboh maka a kate a ba la mboh mata a ba ba a nza andromboh nza a te reh. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Nza maka a ba na Yeso, maka a nza kyangwri anyi tana a bu na vara inyo, atsi tuma ma a huru, na awumu ma itoh tasa lomo a ŋoh yehlehleh; nyiri ka a de mboh. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />amboh ata nza ma a nza andromboh ata areh na iyo amoh reh, maka a leh a bleh andromboh ata nza hunji huru agugu tasa atambri afiya mboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ma huru kyangwri mboh reh maka kwere Yeso la, ta a yi akpo inzi amoh reh ta.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yeso nza ka buti niye ma gbogblondo amwo reh, kyangwri ta ka a bu na huru agugu reh ka kwere ŋoh la, ta a wa ŋoh mata a na amoh ma a ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yeso a kira ŋoh kpeh, neh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Na afiya na kyangwri anzoh mboh ti bleh mboh awumu agbugba ata Ada nza a lisa nnoh, tasa za nza a nza kwini anzoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Kyangwri reh ka a na ŋoh na a leh hwra tsifa reh ma mgba Dikafolis, areh a tsana la, a bu akpokpo afiyafiya mboh agrumavoh ma ikpi andromboh ata Yeso nza a lisa ŋoh reh. Kyangwri mboh nambri maka a shi ŋara aniye ma.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kohmoh Anyifa Anyi tasa Afya Bishi Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Ama 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yeso nza ka aniye ma gbogblondo amwo a hwana fini agba a na na iba ata ari reh, duma agba maka a dohsohna a shi a goh ŋoh na ameh ata ŋoh nza a bu ma akachi fini agba reh. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ma a huru anyimbehreh nimeh agba amboh de ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh isa a ŋoh nza a bu Yayirus, ka a ba na a ŋoh. Nza ka anyi a nza Yeso ma, ka a hwa ma tohmoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Ka a leh atsi kwere ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Anyifa amya akehreh a buti kwo. Meh kwere nnoh ba bu bara ŋoh ta hunji fene ta nvara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yeso ka a wa ŋoh maka a na amoh. Kyangwri mboh gaga maka a wa ŋoh maka a leh ka a yiyi ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Afya anyi a yama ma a huru ata kǝ gu ahushi agrumavoh a hwa afri ka a buti kpa imya. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Tasa kǝ keh wa iya gaga ma ivoh amboh nga wra mboh gaga, kǝ keh mla awumu ivoh a ŋoh trina nambri. Ŋoh neh ta hunji nana zu, bishi reh ka a lisa ka a keh. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Afya reh nza ka a sehreh tsifa ma ikpi Yeso, a ka a ba ba aniye ma hohroh kyangwri mboh na mgba inyina a ŋoh, ta ka a bara kuri a ŋoh, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />tsifa la, ŋoh kǝ gu ma agohsoh a ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza meh bara kuri a ŋoh ma, meh nati hunji wuwana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ma a huru heri kpa reh imya ka a shi, ka a nza itoh a ŋoh la maka nga ŋoh hunji nana.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ma hwana anyimbehreh Yeso a wina la wuwana kǝ kate nyi itoh a ŋoh ta ka a gyuruna ma hohroh duma reh ka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ka bu anyi nza a bara kuri amya reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a bleh ŋoh la, ti kǝ nza kyangwri mboh gaga atsi leh fla nnoh si gyuru luhu la, &lt;&lt;ka bu anyi a bara kuri anzoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Yeso neh ka a leh a were iyo la ŋoh ta a nza akyo ata nza a bara ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ma a huru afya reh, nza ka a wina andromboh ata nza ma a lisa ŋoh reh, a ka a ba na nyiri itoh, ta ka a hwa ma tohmoh a ŋoh, ta ka a bleh ŋoh zizi nambri. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Anyifa amya, nga agohsoh anzoh kǝ nga nnoh nana itoh. Na anzoh nimeh tuma alindeh, tasa za ti hunji nvara nyi ma bishi anzoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Nza ka buti tsifa neh, kyangwri amboh anyi ma anyi afiya Yayirus nza bu agba amboh de ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh maka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Anyifa anzoh reh kǝ kwo. Ni leh nga iya ma kyangwri tsana reh za tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yeso neh ka lisa tswanza a sehreh mboh kpeh, ka a bleh ma agba amboh de ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Kama nyiri kpeh, sa tsifa reh kira ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yeso a kira la akyo ta a wa ŋoh kpeh, ta a bu Abitrusu, Yakubu tasa Ayohana atsini Yakubu mboh tsimoh. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Nza maka a ba ma afiya Yayirus, ŋoh nza bu agba amboh de ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, Yeso ka a nza itoh kyangwri mboh kǝ kwo ma tasa kyangwri mboh atsi kpanga tasa kpiriga mama. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yeso ka aniye a na na a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ leh kpanga te nnoh kpiriga tsifa umbo? Anyifa reh kǝ hehreh kwo kpeh neh a buti leh mla mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kyangwri mboh reh neh maka a wene ŋoh. Yeso ka a bleh ma kyangwri mboh reh la mata a kate a na inziyo nambri ma amoh, ta ka a wa alehmeh anyifa reh mboh ma akre, tasa za ka a wa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh amboh ata nza ma a yama ma a ŋoh reh, maka aniye a na atsi ata anyifa reh nza a yama. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yeso ka a de anyifa reh ma ivoh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Talita kumi &gt;&gt; areh a tsana la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ameh anyifa, Meh bleh noh, hinga!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ma huru heri anyifa reh ka a hinga ta ka a hehndeh, a bu na ahushi agrumavoh a hwa afri. Areh ka a te mboh shi ŋara aniye ma. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yeso neh ka akpi mboh ashotoh la ma a kama a bleh ma akyo ta a sehreh tsifa ata areh kpeh, ta ka a bleh mboh la, tama a nga anyifa reh rya ta a rya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ma A leke Yeso Ma Nazaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Ama 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yeso ka a yi atsi wohroh ata ta ka a gyuru a na akpo afiya a ŋoh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh maka a tufa ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ibi asabar nza ka a ba, Yeso ka a na atsi dohsohna amoh reh. Ka a buti tsana nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, kyangwri gaga maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma la,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">&lt;&lt;Kyangwri areh ka hunji awumu amboh ata areh anyi ma?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ka bu lomo ikata ma maka a nga a ŋoh, sa a wina lisa agbugba ndohmoh mboh ikata areh? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ata areh a bu kyangwri kpa, amehreh Maryamu, atsini Yakubu, tasa Yusufu, tasa Yahuda, tasa za Siman reh kpeh? Asra ifiya mboh nza ma a bu na ambohroh reh kpeh?&gt;&gt; Maka a gu gofo a gya na a ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, maka a sohroh a nga agba ma kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh ma akpo afiya a ŋoh tasa na alohsoh a ŋoh mboh kpeh, ka bu ma akpo anyi tse mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yeso a za a wina lisa agbugba ndohmoh ata shi ŋara aniye za kpeh, a bu gya ivoh ma kyangwri amboh bishi mboh shidi ma mata hunji wuwana. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yeso ka a shi a ŋara aniye ma, tsifa la kyangwri mboh reh ma a bu na nga agohsoh kpeh.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yeso A tohmoh amboh tufa A ŋoh mboh Agrumavoh A hwa Afri</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Ama 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ma huru Yeso ka a hehndeh a tsana mboh a na ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Ka a fi amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh a ba na a ŋoh, ta ka a tohmoh mboh ma afafri, ta ka a nga mboh wuwana ma ikpi huru agugu mboh.<verse eid="MRK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Ta ka akpi mboh ashotoh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo amohnoh anyi ta kama a gu andromboh a de a na hende reh kpeh, ha bu irya, ha a kpanga, ha hungroh nimeh ajuhu amohnoh kpeh, a bu ikpoh tsene ma ni nati de noh. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />mohnoh soh nnoh akpehtreh hwana amohnoh, kama de noh kuri anyi mangara nnoh ma ikpi ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh ma itoh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Afiya ata nza ni niye nnoh reh, tuma noh ma a huru gu na te ameh ata nza ni nati ta nnoh akpo afiya reh. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Atsi ata nza ma a sa noh kpeh, mata a leke sehreh noh reh, kpohkpoh noh huru hwana amohnoh nza ni nati ta nnoh atsifi reh, a nati bu kpra ata ti tsana ma ikpi amoh.<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Maka a kate a na amoh atsi a hehndeh hwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh la kyangwri mboh tama a gyuruna ta aki agugu reh. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Maka a katsi huru inyo mboh gaga a kate, tasa maka wo amehneh ma amboh bishi mboh mata hunji wuwana.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwo Ayohana Kyangwri Wra Batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Ama 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Agohmoh Hirudus a sehreh tsifa ata areh, kyangwri mboh maka a bleh isa Yeso reh a treh atsifi. Mgbiri kyangwri mboh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu Ayohana kyangwri wra Batisma reh ma a yiri ŋoh anyi kwo, a bu wohroh nza hunji wuwana lisa agbugba ndohmoh ika ata areh ata shi nza ŋara aniye ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Mgbiri tswa za la, &lt;&lt;A bu Iliya Kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh reh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Tasa mgbiri amboh tswa za la mboh ma wina la, &lt;&lt;A bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh reh anyi tse amboh ata kiri mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Hirudus neh nza ka a sehreh tsifa reh, ka a bleh la,&gt;&gt; A bu Ayohana wohroh meh ti kǝ shimba ikpi a ŋoh reh, ma a gyuru a yiri ŋoh anyi kwo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Hirudus na ikpi a ŋoh tana a nga mboh aniye maka a de Ayohana a ka ma ida ka. Hirudus tana a lisa dehreh tsifa la, Hirudiya, Afya atsini Filibus, ata ŋoh Hirudus tana sa ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Ayohana tana ka bleh Hirudus la, &gt;&gt;A zohhoh ti sa afya atsi anzoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />A bu wohroh ŋoh Hirudiya ka a gu gofo a gya na Ayohana ma agohsoh a ŋoh, ka a leh a fa aki la ŋoh ta a mla ŋoh a tavoh. Ŋoh neh hunji aki kpeh, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Tsifa la Hirudus a nyiri Ayohana, a wina la a bu kyangwri tufa yehlehleh, tasa za la kyangwri reh a bu na huru zanana, a bu wohroh Hirudus nza a de ŋoh alindeh reh. Andromboh reh ka a wa ŋoh aniye gaga ha na ameh atamaa ata Ayohana a buti tsifa na a ŋoh, Hirudus neh ka a nza nana sehreh tsifa a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ma trina, nza maka hunji aki reh. Ibi mara Hirudus nza ka a ba, ka a fi kira johjoh ibi mara a ŋoh, ka a fi kira johjoh reh ma agbugba a ŋoh mboh tasa agbugba amboh de ta, agohgohmoh akpo inzi a ŋoh mboh, tasa za agbugba kyangwri Galili mboh. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Anyifa Hirudiya ka a kira ma tohmoh Hirudus tasa sene a ŋoh mboh reh, maka a nza nana,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">Agohmoh reh ka a luhu anyifa a ŋoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kira umbo? andromboh ata nza ni kira meh nati nga nnoh, ha a bu mgbiri kpra Agohmoh amya reh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Agohmoh reh ka a faku ma anyifa reh la, &lt;&lt;Andromboh ata nza ni luhu, ha a bu mgbiri kpra Agohmoh amya reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Anyifa reh ka a kate a na na a luhu akre reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh ti kǝ luhu umbo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Akre reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;ikpi Ayohana kyangwri wra Batisma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ma hwana anyimbehreh anyifa reh ka a gyuru a gbo a na na Agohmoh reh na gbugbo ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kira nehnehreh ikpi Ayohana kyangwri wra Batisma reh nimeh gbugba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Agohmoh reh nza ka a sehreh dehreh, andromboh reh ka a wa ŋoh aniye gaga, tsifa la ŋoh neh kǝ shi gu faku ma tohmoh sene a ŋoh mboh reh, a kira la ŋoh ta a ha ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Agohmoh reh ka a tohmoh amboh sumu a ŋoh mboh kwo reh anyi ta ka a bleh ŋoh la ta a na na a de ikpi Ayohana a ba. Kyangwri reh ka a na na shimba ikpi Ayohana nimeh ida ka, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />A ka a de ikpi reh a ba nimeh gbugba, ta ka a nga anyifa reh, ta ka a sa a nga ma akre reh. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />amboh tufa Ayohana mboh reh nza ka maka a sehreh tsifa reh, maka a ba ba a gu kohmoh a ŋoh a na na anyifo ma atsi nyifo kohmoh mboh.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Irya Ma Kyangwri Mboh Dubu Atungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Ama 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />amboh sa tohmoh nana bleh ata Yeso nza a tohmoh mboh na ameh ata ari reh maka a gyuru a ba na a ŋoh, maka a bleh andromboh ata mboh nza ma a lisa nambri reh, tasa andromboh ata mboh nza ma a tsana reh. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Nza za la, kyangwri mboh gaga maka aniye a ba tasa mata a gyuru a kate ma a sohroh hunji aki a rya irya kpeh, Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ba nnoh na amya mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ma atsi ata akyo nza a yama kpeh ti tuma fo nnoh ma a huru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Maka aniye ma gbogblondo amwo a na ma atsi akyo nza a yama kpeh, a bu mboh tsimoh ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Mboh neh nza maka a yi atsi wohroh ata reh, kyangwri amboh gaga maka a nza mboh, tasa maka a nza mboh a wina. Maka a gbo anyi akpokpo afiyafiya mboh nambri a gǝga a na tohmoh amoh a tufa mboh. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yeso nza ka a tamba reh ka a nza duma agba, ka nza kwini amoh, la ma a tswanza atashi mboh nza ma a bu na akyo sumu mboh kpeh. A ka a shi atsi tsana mboh tsifa mboh gaga.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Na mgba nvishi, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a ba na a ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Atsi ata areh akyo a yama kpeh,&gt;&gt;nnoh wa aniye. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Ta kyangwri mboh reh mata a na amoh akpokpo afiyafiya akǝkehreh mboh tasa akpokpo afiyafiya agbugba mboh mata a sa andromboh a rya ma ikpi amoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yeso neh ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Fa andromboh nga mboh nnoh mata a rya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kira mbohroh meh ti mla hungroh ata ka a tswa na fanga amboh ndohmoh mboh, ata nara atsiyatsiya meh ti sa irya nga kyangwri mboh reh mata a rya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu afohfohnoh amama ni bu noh na wohroh?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Na ni nza noh&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Nza maka a na na a fa a nza, maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A hwa afohfohnoh atungu tasa kpo afri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, mata a bleh kyangwri mboh la mata a tuma ma avavara ma ikpi mara bini mboh. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Maka a tuma inzi avavara agrumavoh ida agrumavoh mgbiri tswa ma tuma agrumavoh ida atungu mboh. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Nza ka a gu afohfohnoh atungu reh tasa kpo afri reh, a ka a gu ikpi a ka inza, ta ka a kwende ma Nnoh, ta ka a hwahwashi afohfohnoh reh ta ka a nga ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh mata a gafa a nga ma kyangwri mboh. Ta ka a hwashi ikpoh afri reh za a gafa a nga ma kyangwri mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Nambri ma amoh maka a rya a hunu, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a fira amgbigbiri afohfohnoh tasa kpo ata nza a hwa reh ka a su akwri agrumavoh a hwa afri. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Kyangwri amboh nza ma a rya rya reh ma bu mboh dubu atungu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A hehndeh Ma Ikpi Amwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Ama 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ma huru heri Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la mata aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo mata a hehreh a jitomo a na amoh iba Betsaida, ŋoh ta a treh a tavoh duma mboh reh fya. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Nza ka a yi mboh ta, ka a ka a na a ŋoh agbohgboh anyi la ŋoh ta a na na kwere Nnoh.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Nvishi nza ka a ba, gbogblondo amwo reh a bu ma atsitsifi amwo agba, Yeso ka a bu ma inzi reh ŋoh tsene ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh nza maka a buti kama gbogblondo amwo reh, la inyo reh a fi mboh tohmoh. Na mgba nerebi shishini maka a nza ŋoh atsi ba na amoh, a buti hende ma ikpi amwo. A te tswanza a nati a gǝga a handa mboh, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />neh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh nza maka a nza ŋoh atsi hende ma ikpi amwo reh, maka a nza amoh la a bu yafa, maka a te kpiriga, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Ma a nyiri nambri ma amoh nza ma a nza ŋoh reh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Yeso ka atsifa na amoh ma hwana anyimbehreh la, &lt;&lt;De nnoh ikpi ahroh! A bu Mya. Nyiri nnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ma huru a ka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh na amoh, inyo reh ka a shimbana. Maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />ma a sohroh a wina ila nga afohfohnoh ma kyangwri mboh dubu atungu mata a rya reh kpeh; agohsoh amoh a sohroh a sehreh lomo reh a wina kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana Ma Kyangwri Bishi Anyi ma Janisarat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Ama 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh nza maka a hwana iba fini agba reh, maka a tamba ma mgba akpo inzi Janisarat, maka a lafa gbogblondo amwo reh ma aniye fini agba reh. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Nza maka a kate anyi ma gbogblondo amwo reh dehreh ma, kyangwri mboh maka a nza Yeso a wina. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a leh a gbo anyi akpokpo atsifi mboh nza ma a yama ma akpo inzi reh, maka a fira kyangwri amboh nza ma hunji nana itoh kpeh reh ma ikpi atakpa amoh mboh a ba ma atsi nza ma a sehreh la Yeso a yama reh. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Akpokpo atsifi mboh nambri ata nza a hehndeh a na za reh, akpo afiya akǝkehreh, akpo afiya agbugba ha inzizi akǝkehreh, maka a gya amboh nza ma hunji wuwana kpeh reh ma kpakpranda. Maka kwere ŋoh la ta ata amboh nza ma hunji wuwana kpeh reh mata a bara anene kuri a ŋoh ma. amboh nza ma a bara ŋoh reh nambri maka hunji nana a ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Tsana Agbugba amboh Kiri mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Ama 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Farisiyawa mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa amboh anyi maka anyi Urushalima a ba ba a dohsohna na Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Maka a nza mgbiri amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh atsi rya irya na ivoh ata nza a bu na &lt;&lt;zanana kpeh,&gt;&gt; ivoh ata nza ma a hwara kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Farisiyawa mboh nambri tasa mgbiri Yahudawa mboh maka a hwara ivoh amoh mboh fyafya feh masa a rya, ma a tufa tsana ata ma a hunji anyi na agbugba kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Nza maka anyi kpakpranda rifa tasa ata sa awumu a ba amoh reh, maka a rya irya kpeh maka a wra fya. Tasa za akeki tufa agbugba amoh mboh a yama gaga ata nza ma a de anyi kiri, tswanza hwara akofo mboh, tasa azozo mboh, tasa amba ata karafi mboh tasa atakpa mboh. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Farisiyawa mboh reh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh maka a luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ka bu umbo a te feh amboh tufa anzoh mboh reh ma a sohroh lisa tswanza agbugba kyangwri mboh reh kpeh, mboh neh ma a gyuru a rya irya na ivoh ata nza zanana kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ishaya tana sa tohmoh anyi na Nnoh a bleh tsifa ma ikpi amohnoh, amboh agugu mboh; tswanza ta ka a bu ŋa la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">&lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh amboh ata areh maka a nga meh agba na bina aniye ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">Mboh neh agohsoh amoh a bu gbugba na amya.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Ma krumusu meh wusu ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">tsana amoh reh neh a bu tsifa ata tsana lomo kyangwri mboh.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />&lt;&lt;Ni gu nnoh doka Nnoh reh gya nnoh na nda, ti gyuru tufa nnoh tsana kyangwri mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />A ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh ni kǝ fa aki hunji noh ti ta nnoh doka Nnoh reh, la ti tufa nnoh tsana amohnoh ata kiri reh. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Musa a bleh la, &lt;Nga ma atsiyoh tasa atono agba,&gt; tasa, &lt;Nza akyo a rina alehmeh ha akre mata a mla ŋoh a kwo kanga.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Mohnoh neh ni tsana noh la nza kyangwri a bu na andromboh ata a nati shingi alehmeh ha akre, ŋoh neh ka a gyuru a bleh la, &lt;Ngǝnga ata ni nati hunji nyi nnoh na amya reh a bu Nnoh a ŋoh mi.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />A bu ma aki wohroh dehreh reh ni kǝ ha nnoh ka za a wina shingi alehmeh tasa akre na andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />A bu ma aki wohroh dehreh ni kǝ de noh tsifa Nnoh chakafa nnoh ma aki tufa akeki agbugba amohnoh mboh reh ata nza ni gyuru tsana noh ma mara amohnoh mboh. tasa ti kǝ lisa nnoh awumu mboh gaga ika wohroh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Andromboh Ata nza A nasa Kyangwri ma Tomwo Nnoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Ama 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yeso ka a gyuru a fi kyangwri mboh gaga reh nambri ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kya nnoh ashotoh nambri ma amohnoh ti sehreh meh noh, tasa za ti sehreh wina noh alindeh. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Andromboh ata nza ka aniye a na nimeh kyangwri anyi ma inziyo a bu wohroh ka a de kyangwri a te arishi ma tohmoh Nnoh kpeh, andromboh ata nza ka a kate anyi nimeh kyangwri, a bu wohroh ka a de kyangwri a te arishi ma tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sehreh, ta a sehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Nza ka a yi duma mboh reh ata ta ka aniye a na mgba afiya, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a luhu lomo tsifa kakranda ata nza a bleh reh. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh za ni sohroh sehreh wina noh kpeh?&gt;&gt; Ni wina nza noh la, andromboh ata nza ka aniye a na nimeh kyangwri anyi ma inziyo a ka a de kyangwri a te arishi kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />ka a sohroh aniye a na ma agohsoh a ŋoh kpeh, neh ka aniye a na ma yira mi, ta ka a gyuru a kate ma itoh a ŋoh ma ida abi.&gt;&gt; Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh Yeso ka a bleh la, ha a bu irya ika ata maa a bu na &lt;&lt;zanana&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Ta ka a bleh za la, &lt;&lt;Andromboh ata nza a kate anyi na kyangwri bu wohroh ka a de ŋoh a te &lt;arishi kpeh&gt;. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />La a ka nyi ma agohsoh kyangwri mi kohnoh agugu mboh maka a kate, tswanza tsifa leh kputu atsifi, tasa ayuhu, tasa, mla kyangwri mboh kwo, tasa leh ahohndoh, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />vu, de kyangwri mboh ma agohsoh, huru tsifa, tasa tsifa fa nza nana ata aki abibi, tasa vene, tasa kputu isa, tasa gu ikpi ka, tasa duduna, <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />awumu agugu ika ata areh ka anyi nimeh agohsoh kyangwri ta a de ŋoh a te arishi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nga Agohsoh Afya Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Ama 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Nyi ma a huru Yeso ka a kate a na mgba taya Ka aniye a na mgba afiya anyi, a kira la akyo ta a wina kpeh; Ŋoh neh a bu ma huho kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Afya anyi anyifa a ŋoh akehreh a bu na huru agugu, nza ka a treh a sehreh agba Yeso dehreh ma, ka a ba ba a hwa ma tohmoh a ŋoh <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Afya reh tana a bu afya Heleniyawa. Tama a mara ŋoh anyi mgba akpo inzi Finikiya, nimeh akpo inzi Suriya. A ka luhu Yeso la ta a katsi huru agugu reh a kate anyi ma itoh anyifa a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ta amehreh mboh mata a rya a hunu feh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;A zohhoh la mata a fira irya amoh a nga ma avava mboh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Afya reh neh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Haa, Ada ka bu dehreh, avava mboh reh za maka a rya andromboh ata nza a kpokprona a sangrana ma inzi anyi ma ivoh amehreh mboh reh a tamba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Ma huru ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Tsifa nza ni kira meh dehreh reh, ni nati wina na anzoh afiya; huru agugu reh kǝ ta anyifa anzoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Afya reh ka a na na a hunji anyifa a ŋoh atsi leh ma ikpi atakpa, neh huru agugu reh kǝ ta ŋoh na wohroh.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A nga Wuwana ma Amgbi Kyangwri Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ma huru Yeso ka ta akpo inzi Taya, ka a gǝga mgba Sidon a na fini agba Galili, ka a gu aki a ba ma nda akpo afiya Dikafolis. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ma huru kyangwri amboh anyi maka a wa kyangwri anyi a ba ŋoh, a bu amgbi a wina tsifa gaga kpeh, maka kwere ŋoh la ta a bara kyangwri reh na ivoh. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yeso nza ka a wa ŋoh a na ni nda, ma gbugba nyi ma atsi duma mboh nza ma a yama reh, Yeso ka a sohfoh mara ivoh a ŋoh a na ma ashotoh kyangwri reh. Ma a huru ka tofo ata ta ka a bara arimi kyangwri reh. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ka a nza inza a ka ta ka akpi fene na aniye, ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Iffata!&gt;&gt; areh a tsana la &lt;&lt;Vuru!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Yeso Nza ka a bleh dehreh a treh, ashotoh kyangwri reh ka a vuruna, andromboh ata nza a lafa arimi reh ka a hingrena, ka atsifa alindeh yama a huru heri. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yeso ka akpi mboh ashotoh la, mata a bleh ma akyo kpeh. Nza ka a buti ha mboh reh neh, Kyangwri mboh reh maka a lisa ka hwra tsifa reh a keh. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Kyangwri mboh maka a leh a shi a ŋara aniye ma gaga, maka bleh la. &lt;&lt;Ni lisa awumu mboh reh nambri alindeh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;A vuru ma amgbi mboh za ashotoh mata a sehreh tsifa tasa amboh ata nza ma a wina vuru aniye atsifa kpeh maka a wina vuru aniye tsifa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Irya Ma Kyangwri Mboh Dubu Anneh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Ama 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Na ameh wohroh reh duma agba maka a gyuru a ba ba a dohsohna. Maka a bu na andromboh ata nza ma a nati a rya kpeh, Yeso ka a fi amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh a ba na a ŋoh ka a bleh mboh la, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />&lt;&lt;Meh nza kwini duma agba amboh ata areh, andrehmeh reh a te ibi atatoh ma a yama na amya, ma a sohroh a rya andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nza meh bleh mboh la mata a na amoh afiya na inyo dehreh, mgbiri tswa amoh ma a nati a hwa kwo a yiri ma aki, nza tswa amoh ma anyi aki gbugba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Neh mma ma bini agba ata areh ma sa hunji irya nga duma agba ikata areh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yeso ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu noh na afohfohnoh amama?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A bu atehrehkifi na anyi,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yeso ka a bleh ma duma mboh reh la, mata a tuma inzi. nza ka a gu afohfohnoh atehrehkifi na anyi reh ka nga kwende ma Nnoh, ka a hwahwashi a nga ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la mata a de a na na a gafa a nga kyangwri mboh reh, maka a lisa dehreh. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Tama a bu na akǝkehreh kpo shidi za, ka a kwende ma ikpi amoh ta ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la mata a gafa ma kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a rya a hunu. Mgbiri a hwa a tswa agbugba akukwri atehrehkifi na anyi. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a rya reh ma a tswa mboh dubu anneh, a ka a bleh mboh la mata a na amoh. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />A ka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh ma ta ka a na amoh mgba akpo afiya Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisiyawa mboh ma A luhu Kpra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Ama 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Farisiyawa mboh maka a ba ba a jiji a leh a kpa aniye na Yeso. La mata a tsara ŋoh a nza, maka a luhu ŋoh la ta a tsana mboh kpra andromboh anyi agba anyi inza ata nza a nati tsana wuwana a ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yeso ka akpi izeh fene nimeh huru a ŋoh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu tsifa umbo mohnoh kyangwri ika ata ameh ata areh ni kira la ti nza noh kpra agbugba ndohmoh ata shi ŋara ma? Meh bleh noh zizi, Ma a nati tsana kpra andromboh ma ika ata nehnehreh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ma huru ka a yi mboh ata, ta ka a gyuru aniye ta ka a hwana a na na iba fini ata ari.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisti Farisiyawa Mboh Tasa Hirudus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Ama 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a te kohhroh ma a sohroh a de afohfohnoh a ba kpeh, a bu anyimbehreh ma ma bu na wohroh nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yeso ka akpi mboh ashotoh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh feh, ti nnoh ve na yisti Farisiyawa mboh tasa ata Hirudus mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka atsifa ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu tsifa la nza meh bu na afohfohnoh kpeh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yeso nza ka a wina andromboh nza ma a buti tsifa ma ikpi reh, Yeso ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ka bu mboh a te ni leh tsifa nnoh la ni bu noh na afohfohnoh kpeh? Ni hehreh sohroh nza wina noh kpeh? Agohsoh amohnoh a wuwana? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ni bu noh na iyo mohnoh neh ni kǝ sohroh nza noh atsifi kpeh? ni bu noh na ashotoh neh ni kǝ sohroh sehreh noh atsifa kpeh? Tasa ni kǝ sohroh kohnoh nnoh andromboh kpeh? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Na ameh ata mya nza ni hwahwashi afohfohnoh atungu gafa ma kyangwri mboh dubu atungu reh, a bu akwri amama na fira nnoh ata nza a su a hwa reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Agrumavoh hwa afri,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Tasa mya ti kǝ hwahwashi afohfohnoh atehrehkifi na anyi reh nga ma kyangwri mboh dubu anneh reh neh? &lt;&lt;Tini fira nnoh agbugba akukwri amama ata ta ka a hwa reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Atehrehkifi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ni hehreh nza wina noh kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A vuru iyo Ma Kyangwri Hama iyo Anyi Ma Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Maka a ba Betsaida, Kyangwri akyo mboh maka a wa kyangwri anyi a nza atsifi kpeh a ba na Yeso maka kwere ŋoh la ta a bara ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Ka a de ivoh kyangwri hama iyo reh ta ka a wa ŋoh a kate a ba inyina akpo afiya reh. Yeso nza ka tofo ata a na ma iyo kyangwri ta ka a bara ŋoh na ivoh, Yeso ka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ni nza andromboh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Kyangwri hama iyo reh ka a gu ikpi a nza inza ka ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nza kyangwri mboh; ma a tswanza agbeh mboh ma buti hende a gohgohna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yeso ka a gyuru a gya ivoh ma iyo kyangwri reh. Ma huru iyo a ŋoh ka a vuruna, ka a ŋara iyo reh, ka a nza atsifi a kate. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la ta a na a ŋoh afiya, ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kama niye na ma akpo afiya za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abitrusu A bleh na Aniye a ŋoh la Yeso a bu Almasihu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Ama 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh maka aniye a na ma akpokpo afiyafiya Kaisariya Filibi mboh. Ma aki ka a luhu amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh ma a bleh la Mya bu anyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Maka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mgbiri ma a bleh la, nnoh bu Ayohana kyangwri wra Batisma; mgbiri amboh anyi ma a bleh la, nnoh bu Iliya; tasa mgbiri tswa za la, nnoh bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yeso ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh neh?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ni bleh noh la, Mya meh bu anyi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Abitrusu ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu Kristi,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yeso ka akpi mboh ashotoh la, ma a kama a bleh akyo tsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bleh Tsifa Ma ikpi Kwo A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Ama 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Na ameh wohroh Yeso ka buti tsana la, Amehreh Kyangwri a nati sha iyo kanga ma ikpi awumu mboh gaga, tasa za agbugba kyangwri mboh, tasa agbugba firist mboh, tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh ma a nati leke ŋoh, ma a nati mla ŋoh a kwo, ibi na atatoh a nati a gyuru a hinga na fene yama.<verse eid="MRK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh tsifa reh a kate, Abitrusu ka akpi ŋoh a na na nda ta ka a hwa ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Yeso neh nza ka a gyuruna a nza mgbiri amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh a na, ka a hwa Abitrusu la, &lt;&lt;Ta meh aki, Nnoh agugu!&gt;&gt;ka a bleh ŋoh la. Ni bu na agohsoh kohnoh awumu ata Nnoh kpeh, ka a bu kohnoh ikata kyangwri mboh reh ma.<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ma huru ka a fi duma mboh reh a wa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh a ba na a ŋoh ta ka a bleh mboh la: &lt;&lt;Nza akyo a nati ba inyina amya, a nati a tana ikpi a ŋoh kanga ta a gu gbohrohgboh a ŋoh a tufa meh. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Akyo ata nza kira ta hunji nvara na fene a ŋoh, a nati hunji kpeh, akyo ata neh nza a nati hunji fene a ŋoh kpeh tsifa amya, tasa tsifa nana reh, a nati hunji nvara. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />A bu umbo a nati zohhoh na kyangwri ta hunji inziyo agba areh nambri la fene a ŋoh ta hunji nvara kpeh? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ha la kyangwri a nati fanga mboh ma ikpi firoh fene a ŋoh? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Nza akyo a kwo isa na amya tasa tsifa amya mboh nimeh ika abibi ata nza bu yehlehleh kpeh reh, tasa kpakpana mboh nza ma a hehndeh a yama gaga reh, Amehreh Kyangwri a nati kwo sa na a ŋoh za ameh ata nza a nati ba nimeh agba Ada tasa mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh amboh ata zanana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, mgbiri nza ma a shi ma mareh ma a nati sohroh kwo kpeh, tama a nza kpra Agohmoh ata zanana Nnoh atsi ba na wuwana reh feh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itoh Yeso A sehnehna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Ama 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ibi atehrehkifi nza ka a trina Yeso ka a gu Abitrusu, Yakubu tasa Ayohana, ka a gu mboh a ka a na ma ikpi kpakpa anyi zeh agba ma a huru ka a sehneh itoh ma itoh amoh amoh mboh tsimoh. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Akuri a ŋoh mboh ma a kasa fyafya a leh a kya iyo, akyo hwara ika wohroh a yama ma inziyo areh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Iliya tasa Musa ma a ka anyi a kate ma tohmoh a ŋoh, maka a leh atsifa na Yeso,<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, a zohhoh meh ti bu ma mareh, ta meh ti la dasa atatoh, anyimbehreh ta a bu anzoh, anyimbehreh ta a bu Musa ŋoh, anyimbehreh za ta a bu Iliya a ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />A wina andromboh ata nza a nati a bleh za kpeh, La mboh ma mgbiri amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma a nyiri zizi.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Avereh neh ka a kate a hama mboh, Ma a ka a gyuru a sehreh agba anyi nimeh avereh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu amehreh amya, ata mya nza ni kira na a ŋoh. Sehreh nnoh tsifa a ŋoh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ma hwana anyimbehreh, Nza ma a ka a kya iyo a fa atsifi, ma a sohroh a nza akyo za kpeh, a bu Yeso ma tsene na amoh.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Nza ma a ka a buti tamba anyi ma agbohgboh reh, Yeso ka akpi mboh ashotoh la mata a sohroh a bleh ma akyo andromboh nza ma a nza reh kpeh, la Amehreh Kyangwri a nati a gyuru a yiri anyi ma kwo feh.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Nza ka a bu dehreh maka ata tsifa reh, maka a leh atsifa a luhu itoh amoh la a bu umbo Yeso reh a leh a tsana ma ikpi&lt;&lt;Hinga nyi ma kwo reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Na trina ŋoh ma a ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu umbo a te feh amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh ma a bleh la Iliya a nati a jiji a ba kanga feh Almasihu sa a ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu zizi la Iliya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a nati a jiji a ba feh ta a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri. A bu lele feh ma a gyuru a ŋa nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh la amehreh kyangwri a nati a wa iya mboh reh ma agǝshi kanga, a treh feh masa a leke ŋoh? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Mya neh meh bleh noh la, Iliya tana a jiji a ba, kyangwri mboh tama a lisa ŋoh andromboh ata mboh nza ma a kira reh, tswanza ta maka a ŋa ma ikpi a ŋoh la a nati a bu dehreh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana Ma Amehreh Anyi Nza A bu na Bishi Inyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Ama 17:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Yeso tasa mgbiri amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh atatoh maka a gyuruna ka a na na mgbiri amboh tufa mboh reh, maka a nza duma agba maka a goh mboh a dohsoh. amboh tsana akpi Musa maka a leh a hwa aniye na amoh. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri Nza maka a nza Yeso reh, maka a ŋara aniye zizi, maka a de a hinga na gbo a na na atsifa na a ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yeso ka luhu mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ leh keh mboh nnoh na aniye tsifa umbo?<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Kyangwri anyi nimeh duma mboh reh ka a sa ŋoh aniye la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, meh de amehreh amya ba nnoh, a bu na huru agugu ma itoh a ŋoh. Huru reh a ha ŋoh tsifa. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Nza ameh ata andromboh reh kǝ hinga ŋoh. Ka a gu ŋoh a shebiri ma inzi. Ka a kpa ata tasa ahohhoh a kate ma aniye, ka a rya anyini, itoh a ŋoh za ka anyifa na na wuwana. Mya meh tsifa na amboh tufa anzoh mboh reh mata a katsi huru reh a kate anyi ma itoh a ŋoh, mboh neh ma a sohroh wina kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yeso ka a sa mboh aniye la,&lt;&lt;mohnoh kyangwri amboh ameh ata areh, nza ni sa tsifa leke nnoh reh! Meh nati tuma na amohnoh gu na ameh atamaa? Meh nati de ikpi ahroh na amohnoh gu na ameh atamaa? De nnoh amehreh reh ba meh noh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ma a ka a de amehreh reh a ba ŋoh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Huru agugu nza a ka a nza Yeso reh, ma a huru heri ka a gu amehreh reh a mla, itoh a ŋoh ka a leh a nyiri, ka a hwa ka a leh a kpokprona ma inzi, ka a leh a te ahohhoh ma aniye a ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yeso ka a luhu alehmeh amehreh reh la, &lt;&lt;A bu na ameh atamaa huru reh hunji ŋoh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Alehmeh reh ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Anyi ameh ata ta ka a treh bu amehreh akehreh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />&lt;&lt;Ka a mehheh ka a gu ŋoh a fi a na nimeh shira tasa nimeh amwo, la ta a mla ŋoh a kwo. Nza ha neh ni nati wina lisa andromboh, ti nza kwini ambohroh ti shingi reh zu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu tsifa umbo feh ni bleh meh la ha meh nati wina? Awumu mboh reh nambri a bu ata wina ŋoh na akyo ata nza sa tsifa a kira reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Heri heri alehmeh amehreh reh ka a vuru agba ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh sa tsifa reh kira, shingi meh meh ti sa tsifa reh leke kpeh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yeso nza ka a nza kyangwri mboh atsi ba na gbo reh, ka a bleh ma huru agugu reh na wuwana la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh huru ata nza ni ha amehreh reh tsifa, meh bleh noh kate nyi ma itoh a ŋoh reh, kama za niye ma itoh a ŋoh za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Huru agugu reh ka a te kpiriga agba, ta ka a zuzu itoh amehreh reh veve kpeh, feh sa ka a kate. Amehreh reh ka a leh tswanza kohmoh, mgbiri kyangwri mboh gaga maka a bleh amoh la ha, &lt;&lt;Kǝ kwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Yeso neh a de ivoh a ŋoh mboh ka a gu ŋoh a ka, ka a hinga a shi na a hwana.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yeso nza a ka aniye a na mgba afiya reh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a luhu ŋoh na ayuhu la, &lt;&lt;A bu mboh a te feh Mbohroh meh wina katsi huru reh kate kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Maka kwere Nnoh fya biroh huru ika ata areh sa a kate.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A gyuru Atsifa za ma Ikpi Kwo a ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Ama 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yeso tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh maka a yi atsifi reh ata, ma a ka a gǝga nimeh akpo inzi Galili. Yeso a kira la akyo ta a wina atsifi ata mboh nza ma a yama reh kpeh, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />tsifa la tana a leh a tsana amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh. &lt;&lt;Ma a nati a de amehreh kyangwri a soh ma kyangwri mboh ma ivoh. Ma a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo, ibi na atatoh neh a nati a gyuru hinga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Mboh neh ma a sohroh a sehreh tsifa a ŋoh reh a wina kpeh, tasa za ma a nyiri mata a luhu ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyi A bu agbaa?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Ama 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Nza maka a na amoh Kafarnahum. Yeso nza a ka aniye a na mgba afiya reh, a ka luhu amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ leh hwa nnoh aniye tsifa mboh ma aki reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Maka a bu gbalala ma, tsifa la tama a leh a hwa aniye ma aki ma ikpi la anyi a bu agbaa nimeh amoh.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yeso ka a na na a tuma ma inzi feh sa ka a fi amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh, ta ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a kira ta a bu jiji reh, a nati bu ata trinaa nambri kanga, tasa za ŋoh ta a bu ahwra mgbiri mboh nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />A ka a gu amehreh akehreh anyi la ta a ba ba a shi ma atsitsifi amoh. A ka a gu ŋoh a de ma mgba ta ka a bleh mboh la, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a sa amehreh akehreh tswanza ata areh nimeh isa amya, a bu mya ŋa a sa, tasa za ata nza a sa meh reh, a bu mya mi a sa kpeh, a bu ŋoh ata nza a tohmoh meh reh mi a sa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akyo Ata Nza A fi Reh Ma Tohmoh Kpeh Reh, A bu ambohroh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Ayohana ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, Mbohroh meh nza kyangwri anyi a leh a katsi huru agugu a kate nimeh isa anzoh, Mbohroh meh kǝ ha ŋoh, tsifa la ŋoh a bu nimeh ambohroh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kama ha nnoh kpeh. Akyo ata nza a nati a wina te agbugba ndohmoh ŋara aniye nimeh isa amya, a nati a wina a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi amya kpeh ma tohmoh. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Nza ka a bu dehreh, akyo ata nza a fi reh ma tohmoh kpeh reh, a bu ambohroh. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Mya meh bleh noh zizi, akyo ata nza a nga noh hohndoh amwo wa anyimbehreh nimeh isa amya, tsifa la ni bu noh kristi a ŋoh, a nati a kasa na firoh a ŋoh reh kpeh mbimbi kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andromboh Ata Nza A nati De Nnoh A fi Ti Kpa Hwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Ama 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />&lt;&lt;Nza akyo anyi a nati a wina lisa amehreh akǝkehreh mboh nza ma a nga agohsoh amoh na amya reh mata a kpakpana, a nati a keh zohhoh mata a lafa kpakpa hwa ma agba ŋoh, mata a gu ŋoh a tavoh a na nimeh fini agba. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Nza ivoh anzoh a nati a de noh ti lisa andromboh abibi, biri ivoh reh tavoh. A nati a keh zohhoh ti hunji fene ata tuma atono na ivoh anyimbehreh, na ata mata a bleh la ni hunji niye na nimeh afiya shira ata ka a kwo kpeh na ivoh anzoh mboh na afri ma. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Ma a huru, mgbishi ata nza a rya mboh reh, ma a nati a sohroh a kwo kpeh, shira za ma a nati a wina mlenze a kwo kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Tasa za nza hwana anzoh a nati a de noh ti lisa andromboh abibi, shimba tavoh, a nati a keh zohhoh ti hunji fene ata tuma atono na hwana anyimbehreh, na ata mata a bleh la ni niye nimeh afiya shira ata ka a kwo kpeh na hwana anzoh mboh na afri ma. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Ma a huru, mgbishi ata nza a rya mboh reh, ma a nati a sohroh a kwo kpeh, shira za ma a nati a wina mlenze a kwo kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Tasa za nza iyo anzoh a nati a de noh ti lisa andromboh abibi, fufa iyo reh kate. A nati a keh zohhoh ti niye na akpo afiya Nnoh reh na iyo anyimbehreh, na ata mata a bleh la ni niye na nimeh shira ata ka a kwo kpeh na iyo anzoh afri. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Ma a huru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">&lt;&lt;Mgbishi amoh mboh a nati a kwo kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">tasa ma a nati a wina mlenze shira reh kwo kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Ma a nati a hwara nnoh na shira, tswanza maka a were mma a na ma irya reh.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />&lt;&lt;Mma a bu andromboh alindeh, nza mma reh neh a nana za kpeh, ni nati lisa nnoh lele feh sa a gyuru a nana? Bu nnoh tswanza mma, ti tuma noh alindeh na itoh amohnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Tsana Ma Ikpi Shimba rishi Tuma Afya Mboh Ma Atsifa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Ama 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yeso nza ka a bleh tsifa amboh ata areh a treh, ka a na a ŋoh akpo afiya Yahudiya tasa iba fini Urdu. Kyangwri mboh gaga maka a treh a leh a tufa ŋoh, tswanza maka a lisa reh ka a leh a tsana mboh.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Farisiyawa amboh tswa maka a ba na a ŋoh la mata a tsara ŋoh a nza. Maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ma ikpi tsana amgbasho Musa reh, a zohhoh la akyo anyi ta a katsi afiya a ŋoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />A ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Musa reh tana bleh noh la umbo&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Musa tana a kira reh la kyangwri a nati a wina ŋa amgbasho ta a katsi afiya a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Tana a bu tsifa wuwa ikpi amohnoh ata Musa ta ka a ŋa doka a bleh noh dehreh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />&lt;&lt;Ameh ata neh Nnoh ta ka a jiji a lisa inziyo reh, &lt;tana a lisa atsifa tasa afya.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />&lt;A bu ma ikpi wohroh atsifa a nati ata alehmeh tasa akre ta ka a handana ma afya ŋoh, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />na afri ma amoh ma a nati ka bu uwo itoh anyimbehreh.&gt; Ma a za a nati a bu mboh afri za kpeh, maka a nati a bu anyimbehreh. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Nza ka a bu dehreh andromboh ata Nnoh kǝ dohsoh reh akyo anyi ta a za a gafa za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Nza maka a gyuru a bu nimeh afiya reh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a luhu ŋoh ma ikpi tsifa ata areh. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />A ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a katsi afya ŋoh ta a gyuru a sa afiya anyi, a zaka leh ahohndoh ma na afya wohroh. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Tasa za nza afiya ata nza a katsi atsifa a ŋoh ta a gyuru a sa atsifa anyi, a zaka leh ahohndoh ma na atsifa wohroh reh.<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amehreh Akǝkehreh Mboh Tasa Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Ama 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Kyangwri maka a leh a fira mara akǝkehreh mboh a ba na Yeso la ta a te mboh atoh, amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh neh maka a leh a hwa kyangwri mboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yeso nza ka a za dehreh, ka a te gofo, ka a bleh mboh la, ta nnoh amehreh akǝkehreh mata a ba na amya, kama ha mboh nnoh kpeh, tsifa la kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh a bu ata biroh amoh. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Meh bleh noh zizi, akyo ata nza a nati a sa kpra Agohmoh Nnoh tswanza amehreh akehreh kpeh, a nati a sohroh aniye a na nimeh ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ka a fira amehreh mboh reh a fla mboh a de ma agohsoh a ŋoh ka a leh a babara mboh, ka a leh a te mboh atoh.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Asabara Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Ama 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yeso nza a ka a nati a hinga ta a yi atsifi reh ata, kyangwri anyi ka a ba ba a gya gboro a ŋoh ma inzi ma tohmoh a ŋoh, ta ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana alindeh, meh nati lisa lele meh ti hunji fene ata tuma atono?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu tsifa mboh feh ni fi meh la kyangwri tsana alindeh? Akyo alindeh a yama mbimbi kpeh a bu Nnoh tsene ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ni wina doka mboh reh nza nambri la, &lt;Kama mla akyo kwo kpeh, kama leh ahohndoh na akyo kpeh, kama te ayuhu kpeh, kama bleh huru tsifa ma ikpi akyo kpeh, kama sa awumu akyo na wuwana kpeh, nga agba ma atsiyoh tasa atono.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Kyangwri reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, amboh areh nambri meh tufa mboh nyi ameh ata meh treh bu amehreh akehreh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yeso ka a nza ŋoh a na ta ka kira na a ŋoh. Ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu andromboh anyimbehreh ma ni bu na wohroh kpeh, na ni rifa na asabara ata nza ni bu na wohroh reh nambri ti nga amboh iya mboh, ni nati hunji gohmoh ma inza. Feh ti kǝ ba bu wa meh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Nza ka a sehreh tsifa ata areh reh amehreh kafa reh ka a lafa tohmoh, ka a de a hinga a na a ŋoh na kputu agohsoh, la ŋoh a bu gohmoh gaga.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yeso ka a nza a goh ta ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A nati a bu na iya veve kpeh amboh hungroh mata aniye nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a shi a ŋara aniye na tsifa a ŋoh mboh reh. Yeso neh ka a gyuru a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh mara amya mboh, a nati a bu na iya veve kpeh kyangwri ta aniye a na nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh reh! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />A nati a bu na iya kpeh nyama ta aniye a gǝga nimeh nvitsi akusu wono, mata a bleh la kyangwri asabara ta aniye a na nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a ŋara aniye maka a leh a luhu itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu anyi ata nza a nati hunji nvara reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yeso ka a nza mboh a na neh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri a nati a wina ata areh kpeh, nza a bu na Nnoh neh ata areh a nati ka bu yehlehleh, tsifa la awumu mboh reh nambri ka a bu yehlehleh na Nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh ta awumu ambohroh mboh nambri Mbohroh meh nati tufa nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yeso ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, akyo anyi kǝ hehreh ta afya a ŋoh, ha atsini mboh ha asra mboh ha afiya a ŋoh ha akre, ha alehmeh, ha mara a ŋoh mboh, ha ayeye a ŋoh la tsifa amya tasa tsifa nana amya reh kpeh, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />awumu ata nza a nati hunji ameh ata areh reh a nati a keh agrumavoh ida agrumavoh, ata afiya mboh, tasa ata atsi mboh, tasa ata asra mboh, tasa ata a na mboh tasa ata ada mboh, tasa ata amehreh mboh, tasa ata ayeye mboh, tasa iya mboh za, tasa ameh ika ata nza a nati a ba reh, a nati ka bu fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Kyangwri amboh ata neh nza ma a nati a bu jiji reh, ma a nati bu trina ŋoh, amboh trina neh ma a nati bu ata jiji.<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A gyuru Atsifa za Ma Ikpi Kwo A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Ama 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Maka a bu ma aki na amoh Urushalima, Yeso ka a bu ma tohmoh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a ŋara aniye, amboh ata nza ma a leh a tufa mboh reh maka a nyiri. A ka a gyuru a gu amboh tufa a ŋoh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh a na ni nda, ta ka a leh a bleh mboh andromboh ata nza a nati hunji mboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />A ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh kǝ na ambohroh Urushalima, ma a nati a de amehreh kyangwri a nga agbugba Firist mboh tasa agbugba amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh, ma a nati ahwra ŋoh akpi ata ma a nati lofo ŋoh a kwo, ma ata a de ŋoh a nga amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />amboh ata ma a nati ayoho ŋoh, tasa za mata tofo ata a were ŋoh, ma ata a mla ŋoh na anviri, tasa za mata a mla ŋoh a kwo. Ibi na atatoh ŋoh a nati a yiri anyi ma kwo na fene.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwere Yakubu Tasa Ayohana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Ama 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Yakubu tasa Ayohana ma bu mara Zabadi mboh, maka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, Mbohroh meh kira meh ti luhu nnoh andromboh anyi ti lisa reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />A ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kira nnoh meh ti lisa umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Ma a ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh kwere nnoh la ibi ata tini nati de Agohmoh reh agba anzoh reh, ta akyo ambohroh anyi ta a tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa anzoh, akyo anyi neh ta a tuma na mgba ivoh a mina anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni wina noh andromboh ata nza ni leh kwere nnoh reh kpeh. Ni nati wina de noh ikpi ahroh na biroh iya ata meh nati wa reh? Ha ni nati wina wra noh batisma ika ata ma a nati wra meh batisma reh?<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Haa, Mbohroh meh nati wina.&gt;&gt; Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Haa, ni nati wa noh nimeh hohndoh amwo ata meh nati wa reh, mata wra noh batisma biroh ika ata ma a nati a wra meh reh, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />mya neh meh bu ata meh nati seh akyo ata nza a nati a tuma na ivoh rya a kpa amya, ha na ivoh a mina amya kpeh. Nnoh a nati a nga atsi tuma reh ma amboh ata ma a lisa a gya mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Mgbiri amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh nza maka a sehreh dehreh reh, maka a jiji a te gofo na Yakubu tasa Ayohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yeso ka a fi mboh a ba ma a gbo anyimbehreh feh sa ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni wina noh la amboh ata nza ma a de Agohmoh amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh maka a tsana mboh wuwana, agbugba amoh mboh za maka a tsana ma Kyangwri amoh mboh wuwana. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />A nati a bu dehreh nimeh amohnoh kpeh. nza a nati a bu dehreh reh, akyo ata neh nza a kira ta a bu agba nimeh amohnoh reh, a nati a bu ahwra amohnoh kanga. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />tasa za akyo ata nza a kira ta a bu ata jiji reh, a nati a bu ahwra mgbiri mboh reh nambri kanga. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Amehreh kyangwri za a ba la mata a te ŋoh ndohmoh kpeh, a bu tsifa la ŋoh mi ta a te reh ndohmoh, tasa za ta nga fene a ŋoh tsifa la vara kyangwri mata hunji nvara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Hama iyo A hunji Nza Atsifi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Ama 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yeso tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a ba Jeriko. Nza maka a nati ata akpo afiya reh za, duma mboh maka a wa mboh. Kyangwri hama iyo anyi ata isa a ŋoh a bu Bartimawus, amehreh Timawus a tuma ma aki a leh a kwere. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Nza ka a sehreh la a bu Yeso ata Nazaret a leh a gǝga, ka a vuru agba a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Yeso Amehreh Dawuda, nza kwini mya zu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Mgbiri kyangwri mboh gaga maka a leh a hwa ŋoh la ta bu gbalala, ŋoh neh ka a lisa a leh a vuru agba a keh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh Amehreh Dawuda nza kwini amya zu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yeso ka a shi a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Fi meh noh kyangwri reh.&gt;&gt; Maka a fi kyangwri hama iyo reh, maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Johjoh, ti de hinga, Yeso reh a leh a fi noh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />A ka a shebiri kuri a ŋoh na nda ta ka a de a hinga ka a na na Yeso.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yeso ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ni kira la meh ti lisa nnoh umbo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Kyangwri hama iyo reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, mya meh kira meh ti nza atsifi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Na anzoh, nga agohsoh anzoh na amya kǝ nga nnoh wuwana.&gt;&gt;Ma a huru heri a ka hunji nza atsifi, ta ka a wa Yeso reh ma aki.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso Aniye a na Urushalima Tswanza Agohmoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Ama 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Nza maka a ba nda na Urushalima maka a ba ma Betafaji tasa Betani ma Agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh mboh, Yeso ka a tohmoh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh afri, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;Na nnoh ma akpo afiya nza a bu ma tohmoh amohnoh aro, ni nati nza noh ma a lafa ameh nyama anyi ma a huru, ata akyo kǝ hehreh ka a nza kpeh. hingre nnoh ti de ba nnoh ma mareh. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Nza akyo a luhu nnoh la, &lt;Ni kǝ lisa nnoh dehreh reh tsifa umbo?&gt; bleh noh la, Ada a kira a nati a gyuru a de a ba nehnehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Maka a na na a nza ameh nyama reh ma anida ma aniye aki, maka a hingre. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Kyangwri amboh anyi ma a bu atsi shi ma a huru maka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ hingre nnoh ameh nyama reh na nnoh ma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Maka a kira tswanza Yeso nza a bleh mboh reh, kyangwri mboh reh maka ata mboh. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Nza maka a de ameh nyama reh a na a nga Yeso maka a fese ŋoh akuri amoh mboh, Yeso ka a ka tuma. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Kyangwri mboh gaga maka a fese akuri amoh mboh ma ikpi aki, mgbiri tswa neh maka adada asho mboh ata nza ma a bibiri anyi ma bini. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Amboh jitomo tasa amboh nyina maka a te kpiriga ka a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">&lt;&lt;Hosanna!&gt;&gt; Te atoh a bu na ŋoh ata nza a nati a ba nimeh isa Ada reh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />&lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na kpra Agohmoh ata Ada ambohroh Dawuda&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">&lt;&lt;Hosanna a bu na Nnoh ata nza a bu na nga agba a keh reh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yeso aniye a na Urushalima a ka a na na aniye ma ida Nnoh, a ka a nza awumu mboh reh nambri. Ka a nza la nvishi kǝ ba, a ka a kate a na ŋoh Betani mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A te Aniye Ma Agbeh Mgbungba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Ama 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ibi a te a yanda nza maka a hinga anyi Betani, nyo ka a keh Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ka a nza agbeh mgbungba anyi a bu na asho gaga, a ka a na la ha a nati a bu na maraa. Ka a na a huru neh ka a nza la a bu na maraa kpeh ka a bu asho ma, tana bu ameh agbeh mgbungba reh ta a bu na maraa kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Ma a huru ka a bleh ma agbeh reh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ta a za a rya mara anzoh za kpeh a gu na tuma atono!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh maka a sehreh andromboh nza a bleh reh.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A lisa Ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Ama 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Nza maka a na na aniye ma Urushalima reh, Yeso ka aniye a na nimeh ida Nnoh ka a leh a katsi amboh sa tasa rifa ma a huru reh. Ka a krembe ateburu amboh sehneh hungroh mboh reh tasa kpra amboh tuma rifa na ikukuba afiya mboh reh, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />tasa Yeso ka a leh a ha la akyo ta a kama a gu andromboh a gǝga ma inziyo ida Nnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Tasa ka a tsana mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho reh la Nnoh a bleh la: &lt;Ma a nati a fi ida Nnoh reh la, ida kwere Nnoh kyangwri mboh ma akpokpo atsifi nambri?&gt; Mohnoh neh ni de te nnoh atsi huho ayuhu mboh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Agba firist mboh tasa amboh tsana Akpi Musa reh nza maka a sehreh tsifa ata areh, maka a fa akeki ata nza ma a nati a de ŋoh a mla kwo. Neh maka a nyiri duma reh tsifa la, duma mboh reh nambri ma a buti shi ŋara aniye ma na biroh tsana a ŋoh reh,<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Nvishi nza ka a ba, Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh maka a kate a na amoh kpra Agohmoh agba a ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbeh Mgbungba Ata Nza Ma A te Ŋoh Aniye Reh A shi A hwara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Ama 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />A te na nerebi, nza maka a buti gǝga, maka a nza agbeh mgbungba reh kǝ hwara na ni de ariri. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Abitrusu ka a kohnoh ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, nza! Agbeh mgbungba ata nza ni te ŋoh aniye reh kǝ shi hwara!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nga noh agohsoh ma Nnoh. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Meh bleh noh zizi, akyo ata nza a bleh ma agbohgboh reh la ta a na na a hwa nimeh amwo agba, ta a sohroh a kohnoh tse ma agohsoh a ŋoh kpeh, ŋoh neh ta ka sa tsifa reh kira la andromboh ŋoh nza a bleh reh a nati a bu dehreh, ma a nati a lisa ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />A bu wohroh reh mya nza meh bleh la, andromboh ata nza ni luhu nnoh nimeh kwere Nnoh, Nga kira la ni a nati hunji, a nati a bu amohnoh. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Tasa za ameh ata ni buti shi kwere nnoh Nnoh, nza ni de akyo ma agohsoh anzoh, gu te kohhroh ma, tsifa la Ada amohnoh ata nza a bu ma inza ŋoh a nati a gu kpakpana amohnoh a te kohhroh za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Nza mohnoh neh ni gu nnoh kpakpana atohngoh amohnoh te kohhroh kpeh, atsiyoh ata nza a bu ma inza a nati a gu kpakpana amohnoh za a te kohhroh kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma Luhu Yeso Ma ikpi Hunji Wuwana A ŋoh Reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Ama 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Maka a gyuru a ba amoh Urushalima, Yeso nza ka a buti hende gohgohna nimeh ida Nnoh reh, agbugba firist mboh, tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh maka a ba na a ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ hunji wuwana lisa awumu amboh ikata areh nyi ma?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Tasa a bu anyi a nga noh wuwana ata areh?<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ta meh ti luhu nnoh tsifa anyimbehreh. Nga meh noh kira ŋoh, Meh nati bleh ha bu anyi ka nga meh wuwana lisa awumu amboh ata areh. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Bleh meh noh, Ayohana reh tana ka wra batisma na wuwana anyi, a bu Nnoh tana a nga ŋoh anyi inza ha a bu kyangwri mboh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Maka atsifa alulu ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza mbohroh timi bleh la, &lt;Anyi na Nnoh ma inza,&gt; a nati luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ka bu umbo a te feh ni sohroh sa tsifa reh kira nnoh kpeh?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Mbohroh neh nza timi bleh la, &lt;Anyi na Kyangwri mboh&gt; &gt;&gt; Ma a nyiri andromboh ata kyangwri mboh ma a nati a lisa mboh, tsifa la kyangwri mboh nambri tama ma a gu la Ayohana reh a bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh.<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Maka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh sohroh wina kpeh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya za meh nati bleh noh ha ka bu anyi a nga Meh wuwana lisa awumu amboh ata areh mboh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma Ikpi amboh Sa Aye Inabi Kohfoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Ama 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yeso ka a gyuru atsifa na amoh nimeh kakranda anyi la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri anyi a bu na aye, a biya agbeh inabi. Ka a kpafa aye reh a goh nambri, ka a shumu itsiyo ata ma naka a firu amwo mara agbeh reh tasa za ka a mina ida kyangwri sumu. Ka a gu aye inabi reh a nga amboh hafa mboh kohfoh a treh feh sa ka a na a ŋoh hende.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ameh fasa awumu irya nyi aye ba afiya nza ka a ba, ka a tohmoh ahwra a ŋoh anyi a na na amboh ata nza ma a sa aye inabi kohfoh reh, la mata a na na a sa mara agbeh reh a ba ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />amboh hafa mboh reh neh maka a de ahwra a ŋoh reh a mla, maka a katsi ŋoh ka a na a ŋoh na ivoh wusu. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />A ka a gyuru a tohmoh ahwra a ŋoh anyi za a na na amoh: Ma a mla kyangwri reh ma ikpi, mata a nga ŋoh na isa. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />A gyuru a tohmoh ahwra reh anyi a na za, ata areh neh maka a mla ŋoh a kwo. A ka a gyuru a tohmoh mgbiri ahwra mboh reh a na za, amboh nza ma a leh a hafa ma aye reh ma a mla mboh tasa za maka a mla mgbiri a kwo.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />&lt;&lt;A treh a hwa akyo anyi ata ma a hehreh a tohmoh ŋoh kpeh, a bu amehreh a ŋoh ata ŋoh nza kira reh. A ka a tohmoh ŋoh a na ma nyina, a bleh la amboh ata nza ma a hafa ma aye a ŋoh reh, &lt;Ma a nati a nga agba ma amehreh amya reh.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />&lt;&lt;amboh nza ma a hafa ma aye reh neh maka a bleh ma itoh amoh la, ata areh a bu ata nza a nati a de aye alehmeh reh; ba nnoh, meh ti mla ŋoh kwo, meh ti sa aye alehmeh reh hwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Maka a gu ŋoh a kate ma aye inabi reh maka a mla ŋoh a kwo.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yeso ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza kyangwri aye inabi reh a ba, ka a nati a lisa mboh lele? &gt;&gt; A nati a mla amboh ata nza ma a sa aye inabi kohfoh reh a kwo nambri ta a gyuru a gu aye inabi reh a nga akyo mboh. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni hehreh bleh nza noh nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh kpeh?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">&lt;&lt;Kpakpa ata amboh mina nza ma leke reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">a bu wohroh ma a nati a gu a gya ma chuhu ida.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />ata areh a bu lisa Ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">tasa za a bu andromboh agba ma iyo ambohroh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Agbugba amboh tufa ata Yahudawa mboh maka a leh a fa akeki ata ma a nati a de ŋoh, ma a wina la kakranda reh a bu ma ikpi amoh. Mboh neh ma a leh a nyiri duma mboh reh; maka a na amoh ata ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luhu Tsifa Ma Ikpi Fanga Hungroh Agandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Ama 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />A mehheh neh maka a tohmoh Farisiyawa mboh tasa kyangwri Hirudus mboh a na na Yeso la mata a fa aki ata nza ma a nati a de ŋoh na kpakpana nimeh tsifa a ŋoh mboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Maka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, Mbohroh meh wina la noh ni bu kyangwri bleh tsifa zizi. Kyangwri mboh reh ma a bu anyimbehreh nambri ma tohmoh anzoh, ni kǝ sohroh kira ikpi nimeh kyangwri mboh reh tasa za ni kǝ tsana aki Nnoh reh zizi. Na nza anzoh reh a zohhoh meh ti fanga hungroh gandu nga ma Kaisar ata nza a bu Agohmoh Romawa ha meh ti kama fanga nga ŋoh kpeh? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />A zohhoh mbohroh meh ti fanga hungroh gandu nga Agohmoh kaisar ha meh ti fanga nga ŋoh kpeh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">Yeso neh ka a wina agugu amoh reh, ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh amboh agugu mboh reh, ni kira ti tsara meh noh nza tsifa umbo? Ka a bleh mboh la, tsana meh noh kabo ata ni kǝ fanga nnoh gandu na wohroh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Maka a gu kabo reh a kate, Ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu yafa anyi? Tasa za la ata areh a bu isa anyi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Ma ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A bu Kaisar a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nga noh ma kaisar andromboh ata a bu kaisar a ŋoh tasa za ti nga nnoh ma Nnoh andromboh ata a bu Nnoh ŋoh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Farisiyawa mboh nza maka a sehreh dehreh reh, maka a ŋara aniye na tsifa a ŋoh reh,<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luhu Tsifa Ma Ikpi Hinga Nyi Ma Kwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Ama 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Sadukiyawa amboh anyi, nza maka a bleh la akyo a nati a wina kwo ta hinga kpeh reh, maka a ba na Yeso, maka a luhu ŋoh tsifa anyi la, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, Musa tana a ŋa a bleh reh la nza akyo ata atsini a kwo ata afiya a ŋoh ta bu na amehreh kpeh, kyangwri a nati a sa afiya akwri reh ta a mara amehreh ma atsini reh. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Nehnehreh Kyangwri amboh anyi mboh ma atsini mboh atehrehkifi na anyi. Ata anyimbehreh a sa afiya a treh neh ka a kwo, ŋoh a bu na amehreh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ata afri reh ka a sa afiya akwri reh, ŋoh za neh ka a kwo, a sohroh a bu na amehreh kpeh. Tasa za ka a bu dehreh na ata atatoh. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />A ka bu dehreh za na mgbiri atehrehkifi na anyi reh, akyo anyi a sohroh a kwo ata amehreh kpeh. Nza ka a ba ma trina ŋoh reh, afiya reh za a kwo. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Nehnehreh, ibi ata kyangwri amboh ata ma kwo ma nati a gyuru hinga reh, ka a nati bu afya anyi nimeh amoh? Mboh atehrehkifi na anyi reh tama a sa ŋoh nambri ma amoh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh ni kpakpana nnoh, mohnoh neh ni wina noh andromboh ata ma ŋa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh ha wuwana Nnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ibi ata kyangwri amboh ata ma kwo ma nati a gyuru a hinga reh, sa afya ha sa atsifa a nati a yama za kpeh; kyangwri mboh ma a nati a tswanza mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh ata inza. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Nehnehreh, ma ikpi ata ma a nati a gyuru a yiri amboh kwo mboh reh, ni hehreh bleh nza noh nimeh amgbasho Musa nza ma a ŋa ma ikpi shira ta ka a leh afya akpo bini reh kpeh? Ata Nnoh a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Mya meh bu Nnoh ata Ibrahim, tasa ata Ishaku, tasa ata Yakubu&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />ŋoh a bu Nnoh ata amboh kwo mboh kpeh, ŋoh neh a bu Nnoh amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene. Ni kpakpana nnoh gaga!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Doka Ata Nza A keh Agba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Ama 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Kyangwri tsana akpi Musa anyi ka a ba ba a sehreh Yeso atsi leh hwa aniye na agbugba mboh reh. Kyangwri tsana reh nza ka a nza la Yeso reh a leh a sa mboh aniye alindeh, a ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nimeh doka mboh reh, a bu atamaa nza a keh agba reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ata nza a keh agba reh a bu ata areh: &lt;Sehreh nnoh, mohnoh Israila mboh, Ada Nnoh ambohroh a bu Ada anyimbehreh. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Kira na Ada Nnoh anzoh na agohsoh anzoh anyimbehreh, tasa na fene anzoh, tasa na kohnoh anzoh, tasa na wuwana anzoh.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ata afri reh a bu ata areh, &lt;Kira na atohngoh anzoh tswanza ikpi anzoh.&gt;Doka anyi a za a keh amboh ata areh za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Kyangwri tsana amgbasho Musa reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu zizi nnoh nza ni bleh la Nnoh a bu anyimbehreh reh tasa za la akyo a za a yama kpeh a ka bu ŋoh ma. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ti kira ŋoh na agohsoh anzoh anyimbehreh, na wina anzoh, tasa na wuwana anzoh nambri, tasa ti kira na atohngoh anzoh tswanza ikpi anzoh reh a keh ngǝnga ata maka afya tasa ata maka a fa reh.<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yeso nza ka a nza la ŋoh keh kira mboh tsifa reh yehlehleh, a ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu noh gbugba na kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh kpeh&gt;&gt; Nza ka anyi a huru reh, akyo a za a luhu ŋoh andromboh za kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A bu Amehreh Anyi Nza Bu Kristi Reh?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Ama 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yeso nza ka a buti tsana mboh nimeh ida Nnoh reh, a ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu lele feh amboh tsana akpi Musa reh ma a leh a bleh la Kristi reh a bu Amehreh Dawuda? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Huru zanana tana shingi Dawuda na ikpi a ŋoh ka a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">&lt;Ada reh ka a bleh ma Ada amya:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa amya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">meh nati fira amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh reh were ma hohroh hwana anzoh.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dawuda za na ikpi a ŋoh tana a fi ŋoh la, &lt;Ada&gt; A bu lele feh a nati ka bu amehreh a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Duma agba maka a leh a sehreh ŋoh na johjoh.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Akpi Ashotoh Ma amboh Tsana Akpi Musa mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Ama 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37-54">Luk 11:37-54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Nimeh tsana a ŋoh reh Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh. Maka a kira hende na akuri agbugba, tasa za la mata ka atsifa na amoh ma kpakpranda, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />tasa za maka kira la mata nga mboh atsi tuma alilehndeh nimeh Ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />A bu mboh amboh wohroh nza maka a sa awumu ifiya amboh ata tsitsifa amoh mboh nza ma a kwo reh a rya ma afiyafiya amoh mboh, tasa za maka a leh kwere Nnoh a yanda la mata a nza mboh. Mboh amboh wohroh reh Nnoh a nati a nga mboh iya veve kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngǝnga Afiya Kunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yeso nza ka a buti tuma nimeh ida Nnoh ma nda kakara were hungroh reh. Yeso ka a nza kyangwri amboh asabara maka buti were ngǝnga amoh mboh nimeh kakara were hungroh reh. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ka a nza afya anyi neh atsifa a ŋoh kǝ kwo tasa za a bu iya a ŋoh maka a de mara hungroh nvitsi afri a ba ba were.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yeso ka a fi amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh a ba na ŋoh, ta ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, andromboh ata afya kunu ata areh nza a were ma kakara were hungroh reh, a keh mgbiri mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Nambri ma amoh ma a were anyi na vara awumu ata nza ma a bu na wohroh reh, afya reh neh a were anyi nimeh iya a ŋoh tasa za a bu na andromboh kpeh, a bu andromboh ata ŋoh nza a gya agohsoh na wohroh reh.<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Kpra Mboh Ata Ameh Trina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Ama 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yeso nza ka a buti kate nyi ma ida Nnoh reh, anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh anyi ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, nza jija kpakpa amboh areh tasa mina alilehndeh amboh ŋara aniye areh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yeso ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nza noh mina agbugba amboh areh? Ma a nati a druhu mboh, kpakpa anyi a nati a sohroh a tuma ma ikpi atohngoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iya amboh jiji reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Ama 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yeso nza ka ata ida Nnoh ka a na na tuma ma agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh na ba ari, Abitrusu, tasa Yakubu, tasa Ayohana, tasa Andarawus maka luhu ŋoh na ayuhu la, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />&lt;&lt;Bleh reh, Awumu amboh areh ma a nati a su na ameh atamaa? Tasa za a bu umbo a nati a bu kpra tsana la maka a nati a su?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yeso ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh feh akyo ta kama a landa nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Kyangwri gaga ma a nati a ba nimeh isa amya, ma a nati a landa kyangwri mboh gaga. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Nza ma mlana gofo tasa ni sehreh noh tsifa mlana gofo, kama nyiri nnoh kpeh, amboh wohroh ma a nati a su kanga feh trina ŋoh sa a ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Kyangwri mboh ma a nati anyi akpo afiya anyi a nati a na gofo na akpo afiya anyi. Tasa za akpo atsifi Nnoh mboh ma a nati la kpeh na itoh amoh. Inzi a nati a druhuna ma akpokpo atsifi, tasa nyo a nati a yama, neh areh a treh a bu rina ata jiji ŋoh nza tswanza kpanga mara.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh feh. Ma a nati a de noh a na ma atsi hwra akpi tasa mata a mla nnoh na amviri ma ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh. Ma ikpi amya ma a nati a wa nnoh a na ma tohmoh agohgohmoh mboh ti shi bleh noh na aniye amohnoh ma ikpi tsifa amya. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Tasa za ma a nati hwra tsifa nana amya reh ma kyangwri mboh nambri a treh atsifi kanga feh trina ŋoh neh sa a ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Nza ma a de noh a na ma atsi hwra akpi reh, ta kama a wa nnoh aniye la ha ni nati bleh noh la umbo kpeh. Bleh nnoh andromboh ata Nnoh nza tsana noh na ameh wohroh reh, a nati a sohroh a bu tsifa amohnoh kpeh, neh a bu huru zanana mi. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />&lt;&lt;Atsi a nati a tana atsi ta a gu a fi ma aki kwo, tasa alehmeh ta a tana mara a ŋoh mboh. Amehreh mboh mata a wuwa ikpi ma alehmeh amoh mboh mata a mla mboh a kwo. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Kyangwri nambri ma a nati a leke nnoh tsifa isa amya, neh akyo ata nza a shi a wuwana a na na a te ma trina ŋoh, a nati nvara.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abibi Iya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mk 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />&lt;&lt;Nza ni nza noh &lt;awumu abibi ata nza ka a de lofona a ba tasa druhuna a shi ma atsi ata nza a bu yehlehleh kpeh, kyangwri bleh amgbasho ta a nza a wina, neh amboh ata nza ma a bu ma akpo afya Yahudiya mata a gbo a ka ma agbohgboh mboh. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Ata nza a bu ma ikpi tsitsi afiya a ŋoh reh, ta a kama a tamba la ŋoh a nati a gu andromboh ma nashi reh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Ata nza a bu ma aye reh, ta kama a gyuru a na afiya la ŋoh kuri awo a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Iya agba reh a nati a bu lele na ifiya amboh nza ma a bu na vru tasa amboh ata amehreh nza ma a buti treh momo behneh amoh reh! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Kwere nnoh Nnoh la awumu amboh areh mata kama a su na ameh awo kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Wohroh a nati a bu ameh abibi ika ata ma a hehreh a nza kpeh anyi Nnoh ta ka a jiji a lisa inziyo, tasa abibi ika wohroh a nati a sohroh a za a kate kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ada neh kǝ de ibi amboh wohroh shimba a ba nyina, ma bu dehreh kpeh, kyangwri anyimbehreh a nati a sohroh nvara kpeh. Tsifa amboh ata Nnoh nza a seh mboh, ŋoh a nati a de ibi amboh wohroh a shimba. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Nza akyo a bleh noh la, &lt;Nza Kristi reh uwe!&gt; ha la, &lt;nza, ŋoh ari!, kama sa tsifa reh kira nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kristi ata huru tsifa tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh ata huru tsifa ma a nati a kate. Ma a nati tsana kpra mata a lisa ndohmoh ŋara aniye la mata a landa kyangwri amboh ata Nnoh nza a seh mboh, nza ka a nati a bu dehreh reh. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Lisa nza noh feh; mya meh bleh noh gya feh ameh wohroh sa a ba.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amehreh Kyangwri A nati a ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Ama 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Nza ameh iya wohroh reh a gǝga neh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">&lt;&lt;nnoh a nati a hungwa shini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">Nara za a nati a sohroh a zanana kpeh<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Akpukpa mboh ma a nati a hwa anyi inza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">tasa awumu wuwana amboh inza ma a nati a zuzuna.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Na ameh wohroh kyangwri mboh ma a nati a nza amehreh kyangwri ma aki tamba nimeh avereh na wuwana agba tasa nga agba. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />A nati a tohmoh mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh mata a ba ba a dohsoh amboh ata ŋoh nza a seh mboh reh anyi ma inziyo tasa inza nambri a goh a dohsoh.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsana Ma Ikpi Agbeh Mgbungba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Ama 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Nza nyi nnoh na kakranda ata agbeh mgbungba reh. Nza wa a te avohvoh tasa wa a fana asho afeh mboh reh, ni kǝ wina noh la ameh awi kǝ ba whiri. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Dehreh za nza ni nza noh awumu amboh areh, ni wina noh la ameh kǝ ba whiri a ka bu ma anida. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Meh bleh noh zizi la, ika amboh ata areh ma a nati a sohroh a kwo a trina kpeh awumu amboh areh ma a nati a su feh. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Inza mboh ma inziyo ma a nati a trina, tsifa amya neh ma a nati a sohroh a trina kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akyo A sohroh A wina Ibi Ha Ameh ba A ŋoh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Ama 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Akyo a sohroh a wina ibi wohroh ha ameh ata wohroh kpeh, mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh ma inza ma a sohroh a wina kpeh, ha amehreh a ŋoh, a bu Ada ŋoh tsene. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />mohnoh ni sohroh wina noh ameh wohroh kpeh, nza a bu dehreh kya nnoh iyo! tuma noh na la! <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />A nati a tswanza kyangwri ata nza a na hende ta ka a nga ahwra a ŋoh mboh wuwana sumu afiya a ŋoh reh, anyi ma na ndohmoh ata nza a nati a lisa. Ka bleh ma kyangwri sumu reh la ta a lisa a nza a bana. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />&lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh, tuma noh ti lisa nza bana nnoh, mohnoh ni sohroh wina noh ameh ata kyangwri afiya a nati a gyuru a ba reh kpeh, ha a nati a bu na Nvishi, ha na atsitsifi shini ha nza agba tana a wri ha na nerebi. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Nza tana a kya a kate, kama kira nnoh ta a ba ba hunji noh ma atsi leh mla kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Meh bleh noh tswanza mya nza ni bleh ma mgbiri kyangwri mboh reh la, tuma noh na la!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ma Tsifa A gya Ma Ikpi La Mata A de Yeso Reh A mla A kwo.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Ama 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ibi kira gǝga handa tasa rya afohfohnoh ata maka a sohroh a were atoh kpeh ka a hwa ibi afri ma, Agba Firist mboh tasa agbugba amboh tsana akpi Musa reh maka a leh a fa akeki la mata a de Yeso reh a mla a kwo. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />&lt;&lt;Neh maka a bleh la ta kama a bu ma ibi irya reh kpeh,&gt;&gt; la &lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh tama a fi akpi&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma Awo Ma Yeso Amehneh Angǝshi Ma Betani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Ama 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yeso tana a bu ma Betani ka a rya irya ma afiya Siman, kyangwri reh tana a bu na bishi kohmoh, afya anyi ka a de da anyi ata ma a lisa na kpakpa onis a ba na amehneh wo Nardi alindeh ata nza a bu wi ma, ma a lisa na agbeh nardi tsene. Ka a kya amgbo reh a vuru ta ka a were amehneh reh ma ikpi Yeso.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />amboh tswa nimeh amboh ata nza ma a yama ma a huru reh maka a leh atsifa alulu ma itoh amoh la&lt;&lt;Maka a nasa amehneh wo reh dehreh tsifa umbo? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ma ata ni rifa amehneh wo nyungo alindeh reh na hungroh nara kyangwri ata ahushi anyimbehreh, mata a nga amboh iya mboh!&gt;&gt; Masa a gu a nasa, maka a leh atsifa a hwa afiya reh atsetse.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ta nnoh tsehe! Ni leh wa nnoh aniye tsifa umbo? a lisa meh andromboh alindeh. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Amboh iya mboh maka a yama na amohnoh na tutu, ni nati wina shingi mboh nnoh na ameh ata nza ni kira nnoh. Neh ni nati sohroh nza meh noh na tutu kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />A lisa andromboh ata nza a wina reh, awo meh amehneh angǝshi ma itoh la ta a jiji a lisa meh a bana nyifo amya. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Meh bleh noh zizi, atsi ata nza ma a nati hwra tsifa nana ata areh a treh atsifi ma inziyo areh nambri reh, andromboh ata nza a lisa reh ma a nati ka a bleh ma ta ka kohnoh na a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahuda A kira la ŋoh ta A de Yeso A rifa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Ama 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Neh Yahuda Iskariyoti, nza a bu anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh, ka a na na a rifa Yeso ma Agba Firist mboh. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Maka a nza nana nza ma a sehreh dehreh reh tasa maka a bleh a gya la ma a nati a nga ŋoh hungroh. Ka a leh a fa aki ata nza a nati a de ŋoh a nga mboh.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rya Yeso Ata Gǝga Handa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Ama 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7-14</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ibi kira ata anyimbehreh ŋoh ata rya afohfohnoh ata nza maka a sohroh a were atoh kpeh reh, ika ata nza maka fa Atashi ata kira gǝga handa reh, amboh tufa Yeso mboh maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kira meh ti na ni lisa noh atsifi na ama ti na ni rya irya gǝga handa reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ka tohmoh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh afri la &lt;&lt;Na nnoh nimeh akpo afiya agba reh, kyangwri anyi a de gama amwo a nati a dohsohna na amohnoh. Tufa nnoh kyangwri reh <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />na nnoh afiya ata nza aniye reh, ti bleh noh ma kyangwri afiya reh la, &lt;Kyangwri tsana reh a luhu la a bu ida atamaa ŋoh a nati a tuma a rya irya kira gǝga handa mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />A nati a tsana noh ida agba anyi nimeh ida nza, ata nza ma a lisa a treh tsifa kira reh. Ni nati lisa turoh awumu ambohroh ma a huru. <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />amboh tufa Yeso reh maka a gu aki a na akpo afiya reh maka a na na a nza tswanza nza a bleh mboh reh yehlehleh. Maka a lisa irya kira gǝga handa reh. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Na Nvishi, Yeso tasa mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh maka a ba. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Nza maka a bu nimeh rya irya ma ikpi ateburu reh, Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, meh bleh noh zizi, anyimbehreh nimeh amohnoh ata nza a tuma a rya na amya reh a nati a de meh a rifa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Maka kputu agohsoh, maka tsifa ma anyinyi la, &lt;&lt;Ha a ka a nati a bu mya? &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ata nza a soh ivoh a rya afohfohnoh nimeh gbugba anyimbehreh na amya reh. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Amehreh kyangwri a nati kwo tswanza ta maka a ŋa a gya ma ikpi a ŋoh reh. Iya agba a nati a bu na akyo ata nza a de amehreh kyangwri a rifa reh! Bu ma a keh zohhoh mata a bleh la tama a sohroh a mara ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Irya Ada Ata Nvishi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Ama 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Nza maka a buti irya irya, Yeso ka a gu afohfohnoh reh, ta ka a kwende Nnoh a treh ta ka hwahwashi a nga amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, ta ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Sa noh; ata areh a bu itoh amya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Yeso neh ka a gu hohndoh reh, Ka kwende Nnoh a treh, ka a nga ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh, maka wa nambri ma amoh.<verse eid="MRK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu imya amya ata bleh gyaa, ta maka a sangra ma ikpi kyangwri mboh gaga reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Meh bleh noh shimba, meh nati za wa amwo mara agbeh inabi reh za kpeh, a nati ka bu ibi ata meh nati wa afeh ŋoh ma kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh.<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Nza maka a kpa amumu a treh reh, maka a kate a na amoh agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A bleh La Abitrusu A nati A tana Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Ama 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yeso a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nambri ma amohnoh ni nati gbo ta meh noh, tswanza nza ma a ŋa ma amgbasho Nnoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">&lt;&lt;Meh nati mla kyangwri sumu ata nza a gbo ata atashi mboh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">Atashi mboh reh mata a hehndeh a treh atsifi.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Nza neh tama a gyuru a yiri meh meh ti bu na fene, meh nati jiji na amya Galili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Abitrusu ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza mgbiri mboh ma a gbo ata nnoh, mya meh nati sohroh gbo kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh shimba,&gt;&gt;andrehmeh nashi ni areh ni nati tana meh te na atatoh feh agba sa wri a te na afri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Abitrusu neh ka nata a de aniye a wuwa la, &lt;&lt;Nza meh nati kwo tufa nnoh kembese, meh nati sohroh tana nnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;Mgbiri mboh za maka bleh dehreh.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A kwere Nnoh Ma Getsemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Ama 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa ŋoh maka na akpo atsifi anyi ata maka a fi isa la Getsemani, Yeso ka bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Tuma bana meh noh na mareh meh ti na ni kwere Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ka a fi Abitrusu, Yakubu tasa Ayohana, ka hungwa agohsoh gaga tasa za ka a wa ŋoh aniye, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kputu agohsoh gaga tswanza meh nati kwo,&gt;&gt; ka a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;tuma noh ma mareh ti kama leh nnoh mla kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Yeso nza ka a kpusu a na tohmoh shidi, ka hwa ma inzi ta ka kwere Nnoh la nza a tswa ta iya reh ta kama hunji meh kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Abba, Ada,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Awumu mboh nambri ka a bu ni nati wina lisa ŋoh, gu rina reh kate meh. Dehreh neh ta a bu na kira anzoh mi, a bu na kira amya kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Yeso nza ka a gyuru a ba a ŋoh ka a ba ba hunji amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh atsi leh mla. Ka a fi Abitrusu la, &lt;&lt;Abitrusu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ni leh mla? ni nati wina tuma alete nnoh hungroh anyimbehreh kpeh? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Lisa nza ti kǝ kwere Nnoh la ti kama hwa nimeh tsara kpeh. Huru a kira dehreh neh, itoh a wuwana kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yeso ka a gyuru a na na kwere Nnoh ika ata anyi reh za. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ka a gyuru a ba ba hunji mboh ma atsi leh mla za, la tama azo mla gaga. Maka a fa andromboh bleh ŋoh kavoh. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Nza ka a gyuru a ba ŋoh na atatoh ŋoh, ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni treh leh nnoh mla fo nnoh fya? kǝ tswa dehreh ameh kǝ ba nza noh ma a de amehreh kyangwri a nga amboh kpakpana mboh. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Hinga nnoh! meh na ambohroh! nza noh kyangwri de meh nga mboh reh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A de Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Ama 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoh 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yeso nza ka a bu nimeh tsifa reh, Yahuda, nza bu anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh, ka a ba mboh ma kyangwri gaga, ma a de agbohndoh mboh tasa ambya gara mboh. A bu agbugba firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh ma a tohmoh mboh.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yahuda kǝ jiji bleh mboh kpra gya la, &lt;&lt;De nnoh akyo ata mya nza ni tsifa na a ŋoh alindeh reh, ti wa nnoh sumu na nnoh amohnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yahuda ka a gu aki a na na Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana&gt;&gt; ka tsifa na a ŋoh alindeh. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a sa Yeso a de, maka tsitsiya ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Nimeh amboh nza ma a yama ma a huru reh anyi ka wrofo ambya gara a ŋoh, ta ka shimba ashotoh ahwra agba Firist reh, <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yeso ka luhu duma mboh nza ma a ba atsi de ŋoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bati de meh noh na agbohndoh mboh tasa ambya gara mboh, meh bu kyangwri sene tsifa? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />meh kǝ yama na amohnoh tasa meh kǝ tsana ma ida Nnoh ibibi, mohnoh ni sohroh de meh noh kpeh, neh tsifa ata nza ma a ŋa a gya ma amgbasho Nnoh ta a su kanga&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a gbo a na amoh.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Amehreh anyi ka tufa Yeso, a karafa hwashi kuri lilin ma itoh a ŋoh, nza maka a de ŋoh ma hwashi kuri reh, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ka gbo na mgbimgbi itoh, ka ata hwashi kuri lilin a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Ma tomo Agbugba Mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Ama 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh 18:13-14</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Maka a wa Yeso a na afiya agba firist, atsi ata agbugba firist mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh, tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh nza ma a dohsohna reh. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Abitrusu ka leh a tufa mboh anyi gbugba, ka a wa ŋoh a na mgba afiya agba Firist reh. Ka tuma a lala itoh ma shira ma aniye aki mboh ma ahwra mboh reh.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Agba firist mboh tasa mgbiri amboh tuma chehcheh tsifa a nza reh nambri maka a leh a fa akyo ata nza a nati bleh tsifa ma ikpi Yeso la a lisa andromboh abibi, mata a mla ŋoh a kwo, neh maka a sohroh hunji akyo kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Kyangwri mboh gaga maka a leh bleh tsifa ata nza bu zizi kpeh ma ikpi Yeso, tsifa amoh reh neh ka a sohroh a te ikpi kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Amboh anyi neh maka a hinga a shi, maka a bleh huru tsifa anyi ma ikpi Yeso la: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />&lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh sehreh ŋoh aki bleh la, &lt;Meh nati druhu ida Nnoh nza ma a lisa na ivoh kyangwri reh, meh ti gyuru mina anyi ata nza ma a sohroh a mina na ivoh kyangwri kpeh nimeh ibi atatoh.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Dehreh za bleh tsifa amoh reh a sohroh a ba anyimbehreh kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Agba Firist reh ka a de a hinga a shi ma tohmoh amoh nambri ta ka a luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ni nati sohroh sa aniye kpeh? A ka a bu tsifa umbo kyangwri amboh areh nza ma a leh a bleh ma ikpi anzoh reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Yeso neh ka a shi gbalala ma a sohroh a sa mboh aniye kpeh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Agba Firist reh ka a gyuru a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu noh ni bu Kristi, Amehreh Nnoh ata te atoh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu mya wohroh&gt;&gt; Tasa za ni nati nza noh amehreh kyangwri atsi tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh ata nza a bu na wuwana reh tasa a nati a gyuru a ba nimeh avereh mboh ma inza.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Agba Firist reh ka akpi kuri a ŋoh a hwashi ta ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh za kira akyo ta a ba ba a bleh ma ikpi Yeso za kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ni sehreh noh tsifa ata nza a leh a kya Nnoh reh! Kohnoh anzoh ka bu lele?&gt;&gt; Maka a sa aniye ma hwana anyimbehreh la mata a mla ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Neh mgbiri kyangwri mboh maka leh tofo ata a were ŋoh ma itoh, maka a hama ŋoh iyo feh masa a mla ŋoh, ma ta ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ti bleh wina, akyo ata nza a mla nnoh reh! &gt;&gt; Amboh sumu mboh reh maka leh a de ŋoh a mla.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abitrusu A tana Yeso A te Na Atatoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Ama 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh 18:15-18</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Abitrusu nza ka a tuma ma nashi atsi hwra akpi reh, anyifa nza bu ahwra Agba Firist reh ka a ba ma a huru. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />nza ka a nza Abitrusu atsi tuma lala itoh a ŋoh ma shira, ka a nza ŋoh a na kyokyohroh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:67">Ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu noh ma Yeso ata Nazaret reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Abitrusu neh ka tana ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh sohroh sehreh wina andromboh ata ni leh bleh reh kpeh,&gt;&gt; ka a gu aki a kate ma aniye ida reh ma a huru agba ka a wri. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Anyifa nza bu ahwra reh ka a gyuru a nza ŋoh za ka bleh ma amboh nza ma a shi ma a huru reh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri areh a bu na amoh za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ka gyuru a tana za.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">A sohroh a yanda kpeh, amboh nza ma a shi mboh ma Abitrusu reh, maka bleh la &lt;&lt;Zizi ni bu na amoh nza ni nyi Galili reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Ichi ata wohroh Abitrusu ka kya ikpi a ŋoh ta ka fa aku la &lt;&lt;Meh kama wina kyangwri nza ni tsifa nnoh ma ikpi a ŋoh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Na wohroh heri agba ka a wri ichi ata na afri ŋoh. Neh Abitrusu ka a kohnoh tsifa ata Yeso ta ka a bleh ŋoh reh la: &lt;&lt;Ni nati jiji tana meh te na atatoh feh agba sa a wri a te na afri ŋoh, nnoh nati tana meh te na atatoh.&gt;&gt;Ka kpanga a rinana.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso Ma tomo Bilatus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Ama 27:1-2</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Na nerebi shishini ma Agbugba Firist mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa, tasa amboh tuma chehcheh tsifa a nza reh maka dohsoh aniye a gya. Maka a de Yeso a lafa maka a wa ŋoh a kate maka a de ŋoh a na ma tohmoh Bilatus. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Bilatus reh ka luhu Yeso la &lt;&lt;Ni bu Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh reh?&gt;&gt;Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bleh dehreh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />agba firist mboh reh maka a leh a de tsifa mboh gaga a ba ma ikpi Yeso reh. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Bilatus ka a gyuru a luhu ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Ni bu na tsifa bleh ma ikpi tsifa mboh nza ma a leh a bleh ma ikpi anzoh reh?&gt;&gt; Ma bleh la ni lisa awumu abibi mboh gaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Yeso ka a sohroh a sa ŋoh aniye kpeh neh Bilatus ka a shi a ŋara aniye ma.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A shimba Akpi Kwo Ma Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Ama 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoh 18:39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Bilatus ka ata avoh kyangwri anyimbehreh anyi ma ida ka, a bu kyangwri mboh maka a seh a nga ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Na ameh wohroh kyangwri anyi a yama isa a ŋoh a bu Barabba ŋoh tasa kyangwri amboh anyi tama a de mboh a ka la ma mla kyangwri mboh a kwo ma atsi hwa aniye. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Duma mboh maka a ba ba a bleh ma Bilatus la ta a tavoh kyangwri anyi ika ata ahuhushi reh. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Bilatus ka luhu mboh la &lt;&lt;meh ti tavoh nnoh Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Bilatus reh a wina la agba firist mboh nza ma a de Yeso a ba na a ŋoh reh ma a te vene na a ŋoh mi. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />agba firist mboh reh neh maka a fira agohsoh ma duma mboh reh la mata bleh ma Bilatus la ta a yi Barabba ŋa ata mboh avoh. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Bilatus ka luhu duma mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kira nnoh meh ti lisa lele ma kyangwri ata nza a fi isa a ŋoh la Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Maka a te kpiriga la &lt;&lt;De nnoh kpa ma gbohrohgboh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Bilatus ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri reh a te nnoh umbo?&gt;&gt; Maka a lisa a te kpiriga a keh la &lt;&lt;De nnoh kpa ma gbohrohgboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Bilatus reh a kira la ŋoh ta akuku agohsoh ma kyangwri mboh reh, ŋoh ka ata Barabba avoh ma duma mboh reh, neh ta ka a bleh ma amboh de ita gofo a ŋoh mboh reh la mata a shishimba Yeso mla na amviri mata a de ŋoh kpa.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A wene Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Ama 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Amboh de ita mboh reh maka wa Yeso a na nashi afiya Agohmoh reh, maka a fi mgbiri amboh de ita mboh reh la mata ba ma a huru. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Maka a were ŋoh kuri atisha ata Agohmoh, tasa maka tsiyumu gbama ikpi na atohtoh a lafa ŋoh ma ikpi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Maka a rya ŋoh a sa la &lt;&lt;Agba, Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Maka leh a mla ŋoh ma ikpi na ikpoh kokro tasa maka tofo ata a were ŋoh, maka ada agboro ma inzi a nga ŋoh agba. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Nza maka a wene ŋoh a treh, maka a fufa ŋoh kuri atisha ata Agohmoh reh maka a were ŋoh kuri a ŋoh yama. Neh maka a wa ŋoh a kate a na atsi kpa ma gbohrohgboh reh.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A de Yeso A kpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Ama 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Kyangwri anyi ka a buti gǝga isa a ŋoh a bu Siman nza anyi Sayirin, alehmeh Alekzanda tasa Rufus, ka a buti gǝga anyi akpo afiya anyi, maka a de ŋoh na wuwana la ta a gu gbohrohgboh reh. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Maka a de Yeso a ba ma atsi ata nza maka a fi la Golgota reh &lt;Wohroh a bu atsifi akohkohroh ikpi&gt;. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Maka a nga ŋoh amwo inabi anyi ata nza ma tofo na wra anyi nza maka a fi la mur, Yeso neh ka a leke ta a wa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Tasa maka a kpa ŋoh. Maka gafa kuri a ŋoh ma itoh amoh, maka a were akabeh a fi seh la mata a nza la ha a bu anyi a nati hunji. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />A bu na mgba nnoh Nerebi nza ma a kpa ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Maka a ŋa a gya ma ikpi ŋoh la &lt;&lt;AGOHMOH YAHUDAWA MBOH&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Maka kpa ayuhu mboh afri za na a ŋoh, anyimbehreh na ivoh rya a kpa a ŋoh anyimbehreh na ivoh a mina a ŋoh, <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />amgbasho Nnoh reh ka a su ma ta ka a ŋa a gya reh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a bleh ŋoh mboh ma amboh kpakpana mboh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />amboh gǝga ma aki maka a leh a kya ŋoh, ma ta ka a gohgoh ikpi amoh mboh ma ta ka a bleh la &lt;&lt;Nnoh ata nza ni nati druhu ida Nnoh ti gyuru mina nimeh ibi atatoh reh, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />tamba nyi ma gbohrohgboh reh, tasa ti nvara ikpi anzoh feh reh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Ma aki wohroh za agba firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa reh maka a leh a te ŋoh nyi la. &lt;&lt;Anvara amboh tswa,&gt;&gt; ŋoh neh, &lt;&lt;A wina nvara ikpi a ŋoh kpeh! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ta Kristi ata areh, ata nza bu Agohmoh Israila mboh reh, ta tamba anyi ma gbohrohgboh, la mbohroh meh ti nza meh ti nga kira ambohroh.&gt;&gt; Amboh ata nza ma a kpa ŋoh mboh ma a ŋoh reh maka a leh a kya ŋoh.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwo Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Ama 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Na mgba nnoh atehrehkifi, shini ka a hungwa a hama inzi reh nambri, a gu a na na a te mgba nvishi. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Na mgba nnoh hungroh atsiyatsiya na anyi Yeso ka kpanga na agba yivoh la, &lt;&lt;Eloi, Eloi, lama sabaktani?&gt;&gt; Wohroh reh la &lt;&lt;Nnoh amya, Nnoh amya ni kǝ yi meh ta tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />amboh anyi nza ma a shi ma a huru nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kya nnoh ashotoh, wa a fi Iliya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Anyimbehreh nimeh amoh ka gbo, ka a gu asohsoh ka soh a na nimeh amwo inabi ata jwa ata nza ma a lisa na mara agbeh inabi, ka a lafa ma ikpoh kokro ta ka a de a na ma Yeso la ta a wa. ka a bleh la, ta nnoh tsehe. meh ti nza ha Iliya reh a ba atsi a gu ŋoh a tamba,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yeso ka shimba kpanga ta ka a fene ata trina ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Kuri hama anida ida Nnoh reh ka hwashina a te afri anyi inza a ba ba a te inzi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Agba amboh de ita ata Romawa mboh, nza a shi ma a huru ma tohmoh Yeso reh, ka a sehreh ŋoh atsi kpanga tasa nza a kwo reh, ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Zizi kyangwri areh tana a bu amehreh Nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ifiya amboh anyi maka a shi a nza anyi gbugba. Nimeh amoh a bu Maryamu nza anyi Magadala, tasa Maryamu akre Yakubu ata nza bu akehreh ŋoh tasa Yusufu, tasa Salomi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Nza ka anyi Galili, ifiya amboh wohroh tama a tufa ŋoh la mata shingi ŋoh ndohmoh. Ifiya amboh anyi gaga tama a tufa ŋoh a na Urushalima za ma a yama ma a huru.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyifo Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Ama 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Tana a bu ibi lisa awumu gya bana &lt;Wohroh a bu ibi ata nza a tufa ibi asabar reh,&gt; nvishi waka a ba hwiri, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yusufu tana a bu kyangwri Arimatiya, ŋoh reh a bu anyimbehreh nimeh agbugba mboh reh, ŋoh za tana a bana ameh ata Nnoh nza a ba atsi de kpra Agohmoh reh, a de ikpi ahroh ka a na na hunji Bilatus la ta a nga ŋoh itoh Yeso reh. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Bilatus ka a ŋara aniye nza a sehreh la kǝ kwo reh. Ka a fi agba amboh de ita ata Romawa mboh reh, ka a luhu ŋoh la ha kwo Yeso reh kǝ yanda. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Nza ka a sehreh a wina anyi na agba amboh de ita ata Romawa mboh reh la kǝ kwo, a ka a gu kohmoh reh a nga Yusufu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yusufu ka a na na a sa hwashi kuri lilin atasaa, a ba ba a gu Yeso a gugunu nimeh, ta ka a gu ŋoh anyifo nimeh ikpi nyifo ata ma a shumu ma itoh kpakpa reh. A ka a kpokpro kpakpa agba anyi ka a tamba a na na a hama anida tsiyo reh. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maryamu ata nza anyi Magadala tasa Maryamu akre Yusufu maka a shi a nza atsi ata nza ma a gu ŋoh a gya reh.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yeso A hinga Anyi Ikpi Nyifo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Ama 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Asabar nza ka a gǝga, Maryamu ata nza anyi Magadala, tasa Maryamu nza a bu akre Yakubu, tasa Salomi maka a sa awumu angǝshi alindeh la mata a na na wo amehneh ma kohmoh Yeso reh na wohroh. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Maka a te a shimba atsifi ma ibi ata jiji ŋoh nimeh sati reh a na ikpi nyifo ma atsi ata nza ma anyifo kohmoh Yeso reh, <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Maka a hehndeh a krombohsona ma aki la &lt;Anyi ka a nati a yi kpakpa ata reh anida ikpi nyifo reh?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Nza maka a gu iyo amoh a ka, maka a nza kpakpa ta ka a bu agba reh, maa a yiyi a hinga ma aniye ikpi nyifo reh. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Nza maka aniye a na nimeh ikpi nyifo reh, maka a nza kafa kyangwri anyi ka a tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa a were kuri atasaa, tasa za maka a nyiri. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ikafa kyangwri reh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kama nyiri nnoh kpeh, meh wina ni hende fa nnoh Yeso ata Nazaret, ata ma ta ka a de ŋoh a kpa ma gbohrohgboh reh, Nnoh kǝ gyuru yiri ŋoh na fene, a za a yama ma mareh za kpeh, nza noh atsi ata ma ta ka anyifo ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Na ni bleh noh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh tsifa ata areh, tasa Abitrusu, la &lt;Kǝ jitomo na a ŋoh Galili; Ni nati nza noh ma a huru tswanza ta ka a bleh noh a gya reh.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ifiya mboh maka a gbo a kate anyi ma ikpi nyifo Yeso reh zizi, nyiri ka a de mboh gaga, maka za a wina tsifa na akyo ma aki kpeh tsifa nyiri reh, maka a na a bleh ma Abitrusu tsifa reh mboh ma ziza a ŋoh mboh. Neh Yeso kǝ tohmoh mboh na tsifa nvara ata ma a nati a kwo kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A kate Ma Maryamu Ata Magadala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Ama 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoh 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yeso nza ka hinga na nerebi ma ibi ata anyimbehreh nimeh sati reh, ka a jiji a kate ma Maryamu ata nza anyi Magadala, afya wohroh Yeso tana a katsi huru inyo mboh atehrehkifi na anyi ma itoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Ka a na na a bleh ma amboh ma ta ka a bu mboh ma Yeso reh, mboh tama a leh a kpanga Yeso reh. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ma a sehreh la Yeso reh a gyuru a hinga na fene tasa za la Maryamu kǝ nza ŋoh dehreh neh, maka sa tsifa reh leke.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A tsana Ikpi A ŋoh Ma amboh Tufa A ŋoh Mboh Afri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Wohroh nza ka a gǝga Yeso ka a gyuru a kate na itoh anyi tse ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh afri ameh ata nza ma a buti hende na amoh ma akpo afiya reh. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Amboh tufa Yeso mboh afri reh maka a na na a bleh ma mgbiri amboh tufa mboh reh, mboh za maka a sohroh sa tsifa reh kira kpeh.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A kate Ma Mgbiri Agrumavoh A hwa Anyimbehreh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Ama 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ndo 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Yeso ka a gyuru a kate ma mgbiri amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa anyimbehreh reh ma atsi rya irya. Ka a hwa mboh tsifa la ma a sohroh a bu na nga agohsoh kpeh, tasa za tama a bu na wuwa ikpi neh ma a sohroh sa tsifa amboh ata ta maka a nza la ma a yiri ŋoh ta a gyuru a bu na fene reh a kira kpeh. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la &lt;&lt;Na ni hwra tsifa nana reh bleh noh ma kyangwri mboh reh nambri ma inziyo. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Akyo ata nza sa tsifa amya reh kira mata a wra ŋoh Batisma reh a nati nvara, ata neh nza sa tsifa reh leke, ma a nati lofo ŋoh. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />amboh ata nza ma nga agohsoh amoh na amya ma a nati nga mboh wuwana a lisa kpra agbugba awumu mboh, nimeh isa amya ma a nati a katsi huru agugu a kate ma itoh kyangwri mboh, tasa mata tsifa na arimi mboh atsetse. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Ma a nati a de iyoh na ivoh amoh mboh; tasa za nza ma a wa toso reh, a nati a sohroh a te mboh andromboh kpeh; ma a nati a gya ivoh ma kyangwri mata hunji wuwana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ndo 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Ada Yeso nza ka atsifa na amoh a treh, maka a gu ŋoh a ka a na inza, ka a tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a na na a hehndeh hwra tsifa nana reh a bleh a treh atsifi, Ada ka a te ndohmoh nimeh amoh ta ka tsana mboh kpra agbugba awumu mboh la ta a tsana la tsifa amoh reh a bu zizi.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>